"|<notr>器府</notr>|<notr>Qìfǔ</notr>|Casa dos Instrumentos Musicais|<notr>32</notr>|\n"
"\n"
"**constelacións con número reducido de estrelas no sistema oficial**\n"
"\n"
"|Nome chinés|Pinyin|Tradución|Número de estrelas en *Xianglin*|Número de estrelas en *Yixiang Kaocheng*|\n"
"|------------|------|-----------|-----------------------------|-------------------------------------|\n"
"|<notr>柱（角宿）</notr>|<notr>Zhù(Jiǎoxiù)</notr>|Piares (na Mansión do Corno)|<notr>15</notr>|<notr>11</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>亢池</notr>|<notr>Kàngchí</notr>|Barcos e Lago|<notr>6</notr>|<notr>4</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>骑官</notr>|<notr>Qíguān</notr>|Gardas Imperiais|<notr>27</notr>|<notr>10</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>积卒</notr>|<notr>Jīzú</notr>|Grupo de Soldados|<notr>12</notr>|<notr>2</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>天渊</notr>|<notr>Tiānyuān</notr>|Primavera Celestial|<notr>10</notr>|<notr>3</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>鳖</notr>|<notr>Biē</notr>|Tartaruga de río|<notr>14</notr>|<notr>11</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>天田（牛宿）</notr>|<notr>Tiāntián(Niúxiù)</notr>|Terras Celestiais (Na Mansión do Boi)|<notr>9</notr>|<notr>4</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>离珠</notr>|<notr>Lízhū</notr>|Perlas na roupa de muller|<notr>5</notr>|<notr>4</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>天钱</notr>|<notr>Tiānqián</notr>|Diñeiro Celestial|<notr>10</notr>|<notr>5</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>人</notr>|<notr>Rén</notr>|Humanos|<notr>5</notr>|<notr>4</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>八魁</notr>|<notr>Bākuí</notr>|Rede para cazar paxaros|<notr>9</notr>|<notr>6</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>天厩</notr>|<notr>Tiānjiù</notr>|Cortello Celestial|<notr>10</notr>|<notr>3</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>天溷</notr>|<notr>Tiānhùn</notr>|Porqueira Celestial|<notr>7</notr>|<notr>4</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>九州殊口</notr>|<notr>Jiǔzhōushūkǒu</notr>|Intérpretes de Nove Dialectos|<notr>9</notr>|<notr>6</notr>|\n"
"|<notr>军市</notr>|<notr>Jūnshì</notr>|Mercado para Soldados|<notr>13</notr>|<notr>6</notr>|\n"
"\n"
"Aínda que omitiron as constelacións mencionadas anteriormente, o sistema oficial engadiu novas constelacións preto do polo celeste sur, que non están presentes na Carta Estelar *Xianglin*.\n"
"\n"
"No seguinte capítulo de «Constelacións», presentaranse as 283 constelacións tradicionais chinesas. Non obstante, esta introdución **aínda non está completa**, xa que só se recompilou información básica sobre as constelacións, como o número de estrelas e as súas localizacións. A importancia cultural de cada constelación non se explorou completamente neste capítulo."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Purple Forbidden
#. Enclosure
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Purple
#. Forbidden Enclosure
msgid ""
"*Purple Forbidden Enclosure* (Chinese: 紫微垣, Pinyin: Zǐ Wēi Yuán) is the "
"place where the Heavenly Emperor resides and discusses affairs with close "
"ministers."
msgstr ""
"*O Recinto Prohibido Púrpura* (en chinés: 紫微垣, en pinyin: Zǐ Wēi Yuán) é o "
"lugar onde reside o Emperador Celestial e discute asuntos cos seus ministros"
" próximos."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Northern Pole
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Northern
#. Pole
msgid ""
"*Northern Pole* (Chinese: 北极, Pinyin: Běi Jí) consists of 5 stars in the central part of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*. It is one of the most important constellations in Chinese star culture. The five stars are *Crown Prince* (γ UMi), *Emperor* (β UMi), *Bastard* (4 UMi), *Harem* (3 UMi), and *Northern Pole* star (HIP 62572, also known as *Celestial Pivot* or *Ancient Star*).\n"
"\n"
"Due to precession, the Emperor Star (β UMi) was the brightest star closest to the north celestial pole for a long period before the Common Era, making it the North Star at that time. This period was crucial for the formation of the star official system, so this star held a lofty status and was regarded as the Celestial Emperor. The three stars around the Emperor Star (γ UMi, 4 UMi, 3 UMi) were seen as the *Three Excellencies* assisting the Celestial Emperor, which were the three highest-ranking officials in ancient times.\n"
"\n"
"Starting from the Han Dynasty, the north celestial pole gradually moved away from the Emperor Star and approached the faint star HIP 65595. This was the era when Chinese constellations were finally established. HIP 65595 was considered the North Star at that time, and together with the aforementioned *Emperor Star* and the *Three Excellencies*, a total of five stars formed the *Northern Pole* constellation. The meaning of the star officials was also reconstructed, with the *Three Excellencies* becoming *Crown Prince*, *Bastard*, and *Harem*.\n"
"\n"
"Soon, before the Sui and Tang Dynasties, the north celestial pole approached HIP 62572. This star is also faint but brighter than HIP 65595, so HIP 62572 replaced the previous HIP 65595 and became the new North Star. For several hundred years thereafter, spanning important dynasties such as Sui, Tang, Song, and Yuan, up to the Ming Dynasty when the *Xianglin* star chart was drawn, this star was observed as the North Star in China.\n"
"\n"
"In the Ming Dynasty, the north celestial pole moved away from HIP 62572 and approached α UMi, which is the contemporary North Star. However, since α UMi, as the brightest star in the *Gou Chen* constellation, already had a meaning that had been used for millennia, it could not be included as a member of the North Star official. Therefore, HIP 62572 continued to retain its name as *Northern Pole* *Celestial Pivot*, even though it was no longer the North Star."
msgstr ""
"*O Polo Norte* (en chinés: 北极, en pinyin: Běi Jí) consta de 5 estrelas na parte central do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*. É unha das constelacións máis importantes da cultura estelar chinesa. As cinco estrelas son *Príncipe Herdeiro* (γ UMi), *Emperador* (β UMi), *Bastardo* (4 UMi), *Harén* (3 UMi) e a estrela do *Polo Norte* (HIP 62572, tamén coñecida como *Pivote Celestial* ou *Estrela Antiga*).\n"
"\n"
"Debido á precesión, a Estrela Emperador (β UMi) foi a estrela máis brillante máis próxima ó polo norte celeste durante un longo período anterior á Era Común, converténdoa na Estrela Polar nese momento. Este período foi crucial para a formación do sistema oficial de estrelas, polo que esta estrela tivo un status elevado e foi considerada o Emperador Celestial. As tres estrelas arredor da Estrela Emperador (γ UMi, 4 UMi, 3 UMi) eran vistas como as *Tres Excelencias* que axudaban o Emperador Celestial e eran os tres funcionarios de maior rango na antigüidade.\n"
"\n"
"A partir da dinastía Han, o polo norte celeste afastouse gradualmente da Estrela Emperador e achegouse á débil estrela HIP 65595. Esta foi a época na que se estableceron finalmente as constelacións chinesas. A HIP 65595 considerábase a Estrela Polar naquel momento e, xunto coa xa mencionada *Estrela Emperador* e as *Tres Excelencias*, un total de cinco estrelas formaban a constelación do *Polo Norte*. Tamén se reconstruíu o significado dos funcionarios das estrelas, e as *Tres Excelencias* convertéronse en *Príncipe Herdeiro*, *Bastardo* e *Harén*.\n"
"\n"
"Pouco despois, antes das dinastías Sui e Tang, o polo norte celeste achegouse ó HIP 62572. Esta estrela tamén é tenue pero máis brillante ca HIP 65595, polo que HIP 62572 substituíu o anterior HIP 65595 e converteuse na nova Estrela Polar. Durante varios centos de anos despois, abarcando importantes dinastías como Sui, Tang, Song e Yuan, ata a dinastía Ming, cando se elaborou a carta estelar *Xianglin*, esta estrela observouse como a Estrela Polar na China.\n"
"\n"
"Na dinastía Ming, o polo norte celeste afastouse de HIP 62572 e achegouse a α UMi, que é a Estrela Polar contemporánea. Non obstante, dado que α UMi, como a estrela máis brillante da constelación *Gou Chen*, xa tiña un significado que se usara durante milenios, non se puido incluír como membro oficial da Estrela Polar. Polo tanto, HIP 62572 continuou a conservar o seu nome como *Polo Norte* *Pivote Celeste*, aínda que xa non era a Estrela Polar."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Four Advisors
msgid ""
"*Four Advisors* (Chinese: 四辅, Pinyin: Sì Fǔ) consists of 4 stars surrounding the *Northern Pole* star (HIP 62572). They represent four auxiliary ministers assisting the *Northern Pole*.\n"
"\n"
"Because the *Northern Pole* star has undergone positional changes from HIP 65595 to HIP 62572, the *Four Advisors* had to change accordingly, making the identification of these four stars on star charts often very difficult, and there can be significant differences between different star charts."
msgstr ""
"Os *Catro Conselleiros* (en chinés: 四辅, en pinyin: Sì Fǔ) constan de 4 estrelas que rodean a estrela do *Polo Norte* (HIP 62572). Representan catro ministros auxiliares que axudan ó *Polo Norte*.\n"
"\n"
"Dado que a estrela do *Polo Norte* sufriu cambios de posición desde HIP 65595 ata HIP 62572, os *Catro Conselleiros* tiveron que cambiar en consecuencia, o que fai que a identificación destas catro estrelas nas cartas estelares sexa a miúdo moi difícil, e pode haber diferenzas significativas entre as diferentes cartas estelares."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Curved Array
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Curved
#. Array
msgid ""
"*Curved Array* (Chinese: 钩陈, Pinyin: Gōu Chén) consists of 6 stars in the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, arranged like a hook. It represents the Emperor's harem, with the brightest star α UMi representing the primary consort.\n"
"\n"
"During the Han Dynasty, *Curved Array* consisted of 4 stars (α, δ, ε, ζ). Later, no later than the Jin Dynasty, two stars were added (HIP 16489, HIP 4283). Because the two newly added stars at the hook's head were too faint, its shape frequently changed on star charts. Since the Song Dynasty, it was fixed as 2 UMi and HIP 112833. Later, due to positional changes of the *Interior Seats of the Five Emperors*, during the Yuan and Ming Dynasties, HIP 112833 was replaced by HIP 113116."
msgstr ""
"*Matriz Curva* (en chinés: 钩陈, en pinyin: Gōu Chén) consta de 6 estrelas no *Recinto Prohibido Púrpura*, dispostas como un gancho. Representa o harén do emperador, coa estrela máis brillante α UMi representando a consorte principal.\n"
"\n"
"Durante a dinastía Han, *Matriz Curva* constaba de 4 estrelas (α, δ, ε, ζ). Máis tarde, pero antes da dinastía Jin, engadíronse dúas estrelas (HIP 16489, HIP 4283). Debido a que as dúas estrelas recentemente engadidas na cabeza do gancho eran demasiado tenues, a súa forma cambiaba con frecuencia nas cartas estelares. Dende a dinastía Song, fixouse como 2 UMi e HIP 112833. Máis tarde, debido ós cambios posicionais dos *Asentos Interiores dos Cinco Emperadores*, durante as dinastías Yuan e Ming, HIP 112833 foi substituído por HIP 113116."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Great Emperor of
#. Heaven
msgid ""
"*Great Emperor of Heaven* (Chinese: 天皇大帝, Pinyin: Tiān Huáng Dà Dì) is 1 star in the mouth of the *Curved Array*. In Taoism, the Heavenly Emperor is also known as the *Hook Array Emperor* because of its location in the *Curved Array*.\n"
"\n"
"He assists the Jade Emperor in governing the north and south celestial poles and the Three Powers (heaven, earth, and humanity), overseeing all stars, serving as the emperor of all celestial bodies and constellations, ruling over the stars, and managing all military and warfare affairs in the human world. Thus, he is regarded as the god of war and martial deity.\n"
"\n"
"Initially, the *Great Emperor of Heaven* corresponded to 2 UMi. However, with changes in the *Curved Array* constellation, the *Great Emperor of Heaven* was changed to HIP 115746 until the end of the Ming Dynasty. There are also a very few works that correspond the *Great Emperor of Heaven* to the brightest star α UMi of the *Curved Array*, but this is not mainstream."
msgstr ""
"*Gran Emperador do Ceo* (en chinés: 天皇大帝, en pinyin: Tiān Huáng Dà Dì) é unha estrela na boca da *Matriz Curva*. No taoísmo, o Emperador Celestial tamén se coñece como *Emperador da Matriz de Ganchos* debido á súa localización na *Matriz Curva*.\n"
"\n"
"Axuda o Emperador de Xade a gobernar os polos celestes norte e sur e os Tres Poderes (ceo, terra e humanidade), supervisando todas as estrelas, servindo como emperador de todos os corpos celestes e constelacións, gobernando as estrelas e xestionando todos os asuntos militares e bélicos no mundo humano. Polo tanto, é considerado o deus da guerra e a divindade marcial.\n"
"\n"
"Inicialmente, o *Gran Emperador do Ceo* correspondía a 2 UMi. Non obstante, cos cambios na constelación *Matriz Curva*, o *Gran Emperador do Ceo* cambiou a HIP 115746 ata o final da dinastía Ming. Tamén hai algúns traballos que relacionan o *Gran Emperador do Ceo* coa estrela máis brillante α UMi da *Matriz Curva*, pero isto non é algo común."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Six Jia
msgid ""
"*Six Jia* (Chinese: 六甲, Pinyin: Liù Jiǎ) consists of 6 stars in the *Purple "
"Forbidden Enclosure*, beside the *Canopy of the Emperor* and *Canopy "
"Support*. *Six Jia* refers to the six Heavenly Stems paired with \"Jia\", "
"including Jiazi, Jiaxu, Jiashen, Jiawu, Jiachen, and Jiayin. Heavenly Stems "
"and Earthly Branches are important timekeeping units in China, also commonly"
" used for counting, naming, and divination. This constellation is used to "
"determine the seasons in the celestial world, manage yin and yang, and "
"announce time to people, promulgating decrees and promoting moral education."
msgstr ""
"*Six Jia* (en chinés: 六甲, en pinyin: Liù Jiǎ) consta de 6 estrelas no "
"*Recinto Prohibido Púrpura*, onda o *Dosel do Emperador* e o *Soporte do "
"Dosel*. *Six Jia* refírese ós seis Troncos Celestiais emparellados con "
"\"Jia\", incluíndo Jiazi, Jiaxu, Jiashen, Jiawu, Jiachen e Jiayin. Os "
"Troncos Celestiais e as Pólas Terrestres son importantes unidades de "
"medición do tempo na China, tamén se usan habitualmente para contar, nomear "
"e adiviñar. Esta constelación utilízase para determinar as estacións no "
"mundo celestial, xestionar o yin e o yang e anunciar o tempo á xente, "
"promulgar decretos e promover a educación moral."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Interior Seats of
#. the Five Emperors
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Interior
#. Seats of the Five Emperors
msgid ""
"*Interior Seats of the Five Emperors* (Chinese: 五帝内座, Pinyin: Wǔ Dì Nèi Zuò)"
" consists of 5 stars under the *Canopy of the Emperor*, beside the *Canopy "
"Support*. They are the seats of the Five Emperors of the five directions. "
"The Five Emperors include the Green Emperor, Red Emperor, Yellow Emperor, "
"White Emperor, and Black Emperor, corresponding to the east, south, center, "
"west, and north directions respectively."
msgstr ""
"Os *Asentos interiores dos Cinco Emperadores* (en chinés: 五帝内座, en pinyin: "
"Wǔ Dì Nèi Zuò) constan de 5 estrelas baixo o *Dosel do Emperador*, onda o "
"*Soporte do Dosel*. Son os asentos dos Cinco Emperadores das cinco "
"direccións. Os Cinco Emperadores inclúen o Emperador Verde, o Emperador "
"Vermello, o Emperador Amarelo, o Emperador Branco e o Emperador Negro, "
"correspondentes ás direccións leste, sur, centro, oeste e norte, "
"respectivamente."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Canopy of the
#. Emperor
msgid ""
"*Canopy of the Emperor* (Chinese: 华盖, Pinyin: Huá Gài) consists of 7 stars "
"above the *Great Emperor of Heaven*, at the back gate of the *Purple "
"Forbidden Enclosure*, just covering the *Great Emperor of Heaven*. It is the"
" umbrella used by the Emperor."
msgstr ""
"O *Dosel do Emperador* (en chinés: 华盖, en pinyin: Huá Gài) consiste en 7 "
"estrelas por riba do *Gran Emperador do Ceo*, na porta traseira do *Recinto "
"Púrpura Prohibido*, cubrindo xusto o *Gran Emperador do Ceo*. É o parasol "
"que usa o Emperador."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Canopy Support
#. (Vassal of Canopy of the Emperor)
msgid ""
"*Canopy Support* (Chinese: 杠, Pinyin: Gàng) consists of 9 stars under the "
"*Canopy of the Emperor*, serving as the handle of the canopy."
msgstr ""
"O *Soporte do dosel* (en chinés: 杠, en pinyin: Gàng) consta de 9 estrelas "
"baixo o *Dosel do Emperador*, que serve como asa do dosel."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Pillar
msgid ""
"*Celestial Pillar* (Chinese: 天柱, Pinyin: Tiān Zhù) consists of 5 stars near "
"the *Purple Forbidden East Wall*, close to the northern end of the wall. "
"They are pillars in the Heavenly Palace used for posting decrees. Bans are "
"often issued here at the beginning and middle of the month to notify all "
"officials."
msgstr ""
"O *Piar Celestial* (en chinés: 天柱, en pinyin: Tiān Zhù) consta de 5 estrelas"
" preto do *Muro Leste Prohibido Púrpura*, preto do extremo norte do muro. "
"Son piares no Palacio Celestial que se usan para publicar decretos. A miúdo "
"emítense prohibicións aquí a principios e mediados de mes para notificar a "
"todos os funcionarios."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Maids-in-waiting
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Maids-in-
#. waiting
msgid ""
"*Maids-in-waiting* (Chinese: 御女, Pinyin: Yù Nǚ) consists of 4 stars north of"
" the *Curved Array*, serving as maids in the palace."
msgstr ""
"As *Damas de compañía* (en chinés: 御女, en pinyin: Yù Nǚ) constan de 4 "
"estrelas ó norte da *Matriz Curva*, que serven como criadas no palacio."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official of Royal
#. Archives
msgid ""
"*Official of Royal Archives* (Chinese: 柱史, Pinyin: Zhù Shǐ) is 1 star "
"northeast of the *Northern Pole*, close to the *Royal Secretary*. It is a "
"historian responsible for recording daily affairs in the palace."
msgstr ""
"*Funcionario dos Arquivos Reais* (en chinés: 柱史, en pinyin: Zhù Shǐ) está "
"situado 1 estrela ó nordeste do *Polo Norte*, preto do *Secretario Real*. É "
"un historiador responsable de rexistrar os asuntos diarios do palacio."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Female Protocol
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Female
#. Protocol
msgid ""
"*Female Protocol* (Chinese: 女史, Pinyin: Nǚ Shǐ) is 1 star north of the "
"*Official of Royal Archives*. It is a female official in charge of "
"timekeeping by water clock in the palace."
msgstr ""
"*Protocolo feminino* (en chinés: 女史, en pinyin: Nǚ Shǐ) é unha estrela "
"situada ó norte do *Funcionario dos Arquivos Reais*. É un funcionario "
"encargado de controlar o tempo mediante un reloxo de auga no palacio."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Royal Secretary
msgid ""
"*Royal Secretary* (Chinese: 尚书, Pinyin: Shàng Shū) consists of 5 stars in "
"the southeast corner of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, inside the south "
"gate. It is an official responsible for documents and memorials, offering "
"advice to the Heavenly Emperor."
msgstr ""
"O *Secretario Real* (en chinés: 尚书, en pinyin: Shàng Shū) consta de 5 "
"estrelas na esquina sueste do *Recinto Prohibido Púrpura*, dentro da porta "
"sur. É un funcionario responsable dos documentos eómemoriais, que ofrece "
"consellos ó Emperador Celestial."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Hidden Virtue
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Hidden
#. Virtue
msgid ""
"*Hidden Virtue* (Chinese: 阴德, Pinyin: Yīn Dé) consists of 2 stars inside the"
" *Purple Forbidden Enclosure* gate, west of the *Royal Secretary*. It refers"
" to good deeds done in secret, in charge of benefiting the people and "
"providing relief and comfort."
msgstr ""
"*Virtude Oculta* (en chinés: 阴德, en pinyin: Yīn Dé) consta de 2 estrelas "
"dentro da porta *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, ó oeste do *Secretario Real*. "
"Refírese ás boas accións realizadas en segredo, encargadas de beneficiar á "
"xente e proporcionar alivio e consolo."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Chief Judge
msgid ""
"*Chief Judge* (Chinese: 大理, Pinyin: Dà Lǐ) consists of 2 stars inside the "
"left star of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure* gate, close to *Hidden "
"Virtue*. It is an official in charge of trial and punishment, used for "
"divining wrongful convictions."
msgstr ""
"*Xuíz xefe* (en chinés: 大理, en pinyin: Dà Lǐ) consta de 2 estrelas dentro da"
" estrela esquerda da porta *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, preto da *Virtude "
"Oculta*. É un funcionario encargado dos xuízos e castigos, utilizado para "
"discernir condenas inxustas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Bed
msgid ""
"*Celestial Bed* (Chinese: 天床, Pinyin: Tiān Chuáng) consists of 6 stars "
"outside the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure* gate. It is the bed where the "
"Heavenly Emperor sleeps and rests."
msgstr ""
"*Leito Celestial* (en chinés: 天床, en pinyin: Tiān Chuáng) consta de 6 "
"estrelas fóra da porta *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*. É a cama onde dorme e "
"descansa o Emperador Celestial."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Purple Forbidden
#. East Wall
msgid ""
"*Purple Forbidden East Wall* (Chinese: 紫微垣东蕃, Pinyin: Zǐ Wēi Yuán Dōng Fān) "
"consists of 8 stars, the left or eastern wall of the *Purple Forbidden "
"Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"O *Muro Leste Prohibido Púrpura* (en chinés: 紫微垣东蕃, en pinyin: Zǐ Wēi Yuán "
"Dōng Fān) consta de 8 estrelas, o muro esquerdo ou leste do *Recinto "
"Prohibido Púrpura*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Purple Forbidden
#. West Wall
msgid ""
"*Purple Forbidden West Wall* (Chinese: 紫微垣西蕃, Pinyin: Zǐ Wēi Yuán Xī Fān) "
"consists of 7 stars, the right or western wall of the *Purple Forbidden "
"Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"O *Muro Oeste Prohibido Púrpura* (en chinés: 紫微垣西蕃, en pinyin: Zǐ Wēi Yuán "
"Xī Fān) consta de 7 estrelas, o muro dereito ou oeste do *Recinto Prohibido "
"Púrpura*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Great
#. One
msgid ""
"*Celestial Great One* (Chinese: 天乙, Pinyin: Tiān Yǐ) is 1 star outside the "
"*Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, south of the right star of the palace gate. It"
" is the god of the Heavenly Emperor, governing the operation of the Heavenly"
" Tao, coordinating the twelve divine generals, and presiding over wars and "
"personal good fortune."
msgstr ""
"*O Grande Celestial* (en chinés: 天乙, en pinyin: Tiān Yǐ) é unha estrela "
"situada fóra do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, ó sur da estrela dereita da "
"porta do palacio. É o deus do Emperador Celestial, que goberna o "
"funcionamento do Tao Celestial, coordina os doce xenerais divinos e preside "
"as guerras e a boa fortuna persoal."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation First Great One
msgid ""
"*First Great One* (Chinese: 太乙, Pinyin: Tài Yǐ) is 1 star south of "
"*Celestial Great One*, close to it. It governs the sixteen gods and is "
"responsible for predicting natural disasters and social upheavals such as "
"wind, rain, floods, droughts, wars, famines, and plagues."
msgstr ""
"*Primeiro Grande* (en chinés: 太乙, en pinyin: Tài Yǐ) está situado a unha "
"estrela ó sur do *Grande Celestial*, preto del. Goberna os dezaseis deuses e"
" é o responsable de predicir desastres naturais e convulsións sociais como "
"vento, choiva, inundacións, secas, guerras, fames e pestes."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Inner Kitchen
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Inner
#. Kitchen
msgid ""
"*Inner Kitchen* (Chinese: 内厨, Pinyin: Nèi Chú) consists of 2 stars outside "
"the southwest corner of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, the kitchen "
"responsible for the palace's diet."
msgstr ""
"A *Cociña Interior* (en chinés: 内厨, en pinyin: Nèi Chú) consta de 2 estrelas"
" fóra da esquina suroeste do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, a cociña "
"responsable da dieta do palacio."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Kitchen
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Kitchen
msgid ""
"*Celestial Kitchen* (Chinese: 天厨, Pinyin: Tiān Chú) consists of 6 stars "
"outside the northeast corner of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, the "
"kitchen responsible for state banquet catering."
msgstr ""
"A *Cociña Celestial* (en chinés: 天厨, en pinyin: Tiān Chú) consta de 6 "
"estrelas fóra da esquina nordeste do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, a cociña "
"responsable do cátering dos banquetes estatais."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Guest House
msgid ""
"*Guest House* (Chinese: 传舍, Pinyin: Chuán Shè) consists of 9 stars outside "
"the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, above the *Canopy of the Emperor*, close "
"to the Milky Way. It is a place for guests to stay."
msgstr ""
"*Casa de hóspedes* (en chinés: 传舍, en pinyin: Chuán Shè) consta de 9 "
"estrelas fóra do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, sobre o *Dosel do Emperador*, "
"preto da Vía Láctea. É un lugar onde se aloxan os hóspedes."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Eight Kinds of
#. Crops
msgid ""
"*Eight Kinds of Crops* (Chinese: 八谷, Pinyin: Bā Gǔ) consists of 8 stars "
"north of the *Five Chariots*, in front of the *Inner Steps*. The eight kinds"
" of grain crops are rice, millet, barley, wheat, soybeans, small beans, "
"millet, and hemp. They are used for divining agricultural harvests."
msgstr ""
"*Oito tipos de cultivos* (chinés: 八谷, pinyin: Bā Gǔ) consta de 8 estrelas ó "
"norte dos *Cinco carros*, diante das *Escadas Interiores*. Os oito tipos de "
"cultivos de grans son o arroz, o millo, a cebada, o trigo, a soia, os "
"feixóns pequenos, o millo e o cánabo. Utilízanse para adiviñar as colleitas "
"agrícolas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Inner Steps
msgid ""
"*Inner Steps* (Chinese: 内阶, Pinyin: Nèi Jiē) consists of 6 stars north of "
"the *Administrative Center*, the steps for the Heavenly Emperor to go up and"
" down, connecting the back gate of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure* with the"
" *Administrative Center*."
msgstr ""
"As *Escadas Interiores* (en chinés: 内阶, en pinyin: Nèi Jiē) constan de 6 "
"estrelas ó norte do *Centro Administrativo*, as escaleiras para que o "
"Emperador Celestial suba e baixe, conectando a porta traseira do *Recinto "
"Púrpura Prohibido* co *Centro Administrativo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Administrative
#. Center
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation
#. Administrative Center
msgid ""
"*Administrative Center* (Chinese: 文昌, Pinyin: Wén Chāng) consists of 6 stars in front of the bowl of the *Northern Dipper* (the Big Dipper), west of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, shaped like a half-moon and a basket, known as \"the dipper wearing a basket\". It is a collective name for six government departments or officials, including the *Great General*, *Second General*, *Distinguished Premier*, *Deified Judge of Life*, *Deified Judge of Central Affairs*, and *Deified Judge of Rank*, in charge of cultural education, etiquette and music, rewarding and punishing officials, adding salaries, and promoting officials to higher positions.\n"
"\n"
"There are two theories regarding the number of stars in this constellation: six or seven. The original version consisted of seven stars: ο, τ, 23, υ, φ, θ, 15 UMa. In later Chinese traditions, the six-star version became mainstream. During the Tang Dynasty, due to inaccuracies in star charting, the entire constellation rotated counterclockwise, leading to changes in the corresponding stars, which were then altered to 23, υ, φ, θ, 15, HIP 44504/18 UMa, making a total of six stars. However, the older version continued to circulate. The *Administrative Center* constellation depicted in the *Xianglin* star chart is the early, unaltered version."
msgstr ""
"O *Centro Administrativo* (en chinés: 文昌, en pinyin: Wén Chāng) consta de 6 estrelas diante da cunca da *Culler do Norte* (o Carro Maior), ó oeste do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, con forma de media lúa e cesta, coñecido como \"o mergullador que leva unha cesta\". É un nome colectivo para seis departamentos ou funcionarios gobernamentais, incluíndo o *Gran Xeneral*, o *Segundo Xeneral*, o *Primeiro Ministro Distinguido*, o *Xuíz Deificado de Vida*, o *Xuíz Deificado de Asuntos Centrais* e o *Xuíz Deificado de Rango*, encargados da educación cultural, a etiqueta e a música, recompensando e castigando os funcionarios, engadindo salarios e ascendendo a funcionarios a postos máis altos.\n"
"\n"
"Hai dúas teorías sobre o número de estrelas nesta constelación: seis ou sete. A versión orixinal constaba de sete estrelas: ο, τ, 23, υ, φ, θ, 15 UMa. Nas tradicións chinesas posteriores, a versión de seis estrelas converteuse na corrente principal. Durante a dinastía Tang, debido a inexactitudes na representación das cartas estelares, toda a constelación xiraba en sentido antihorario, o que provocaba cambios nas estrelas correspondentes, que logo se alteraban a 23, υ, φ, θ, 15, HIP 44504/18 UMa, o que facía un total de seis estrelas. Non obstante, a versión máis antiga continuou a circular. A constelación do *Centro Administrativo* representada na carta estelar *Xianglin* é a versión primitiva e inalterada."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Prison
msgid ""
"*Celestial Prison* (Chinese: 天牢, Pinyin: Tiān Láo) consists of 6 stars under"
" the bowl of *Northern Dipper*, a prison for detaining law-breaking nobles."
msgstr ""
"A *Prisión Celestial* (en chinés: 天牢, en pinyin: Tiān Láo) consta de 6 "
"estrelas baixo a cunca da *Culler do Norte*, unha prisión para deter nobres "
"que violan a lei."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Top
#. Instructors
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Three Top
#. Instructors
msgid ""
"*Three Top Instructors* (Chinese: 三师, Pinyin: Sān Shī) consists of 3 stars "
"west of the first star (α UMa) of the bowl of the *Northern Dipper*. The "
"*Three Top Instructors* are the *Grand Protector*, *Grand Tutor*, and *Grand"
" Preceptor*, the highest officials responsible for national military and "
"political affairs."
msgstr ""
"Os *Tres Instrutores Superiores* (en chinés: 三师, en pinyin: Sān Shī) constan"
" de 3 estrelas ó oeste da primeira estrela (α UMa) da cunca da *Culler do "
"Norte*. Os *Tres Instrutores Superiores* son o *Gran Protector*, o *Gran "
"Titor* e o *Gran Preceptor*, os máis altos funcionarios responsables dos "
"asuntos militares e políticos nacionais."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Northern Dipper
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Northern
#. Dipper
msgid ""
"*Northern Dipper* (Chinese: 北斗, Pinyin: Běi Dǒu) consists of 7 stars south of the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, corresponds to the Big Dipper in the West. The first 4 stars (α, β, γ, δ UMa) are called *Dou Kui* (the Bowl or Ladle's Head), and the last 3 stars (ε, ζ, η UMa) are called *Dou Bing* or *Dou Shao* (the Handle). Shaped like a ladle and located in the northern sky, it symbolizes the Heavenly Emperor's chariot.\n"
"\n"
"The *Northern Dipper* lies within the circumpolar circle, is highly distinctive, and its stars are bright. Therefore, it became a crucial constellation for determining direction and indicating the seasons. By using the *Northern Dipper*, one can easily locate other bright stars and constellations in the sky."
msgstr ""
"A *Culler do Norte* (en chinés: 北斗, en pinyin: Běi Dǒu) consta de 7 estrelas ó sur do *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, e corresponde á Osa Maior no oeste. As primeiras 4 estrelas (α, β, γ, δ UMa) chámanse *Dou Kui* (a cunca ou a cabeza da culler), e as últimas 3 estrelas (ε, ζ, η UMa) chámanse *Dou Bing* ou *Dou Shao* (o mango). Ten forma de culler e está situada no ceo setentrional; simboliza o carro do Emperador Celestial.\n"
"\n"
"A *Culler do Norte* atópase dentro do círculo circumpolar, é moi distintiva e as súas estrelas son brillantes. Polo tanto, converteuse nunha constelación crucial para determinar a dirección e indicar as estacións. Usando a *Culler do Norte*, pódense localizar facilmente outras estrelas e constelacións brillantes no ceo."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Assistant (Vassal
#. of Northern Dipper)
msgid ""
"*Assistant* (Chinese: 辅, Pinyin: Fǔ) is 1 star, the prime minister or "
"minister assisting the *Northern Dipper*."
msgstr ""
"*Asistente* (en chinés: 辅, en pinyin: Fǔ)  está a 1 estrela do primeiro "
"ministro ou ministro que axuda á *Culler do Norte*, cunha estrela."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Judge for Nobility
msgid ""
"*Judge for Nobility* (Chinese: 天理, Pinyin: Tiān Lǐ) consists of 4 stars in "
"the *Northern Dipper*'s dipper. It is a prison for nobles and also a law "
"enforcement official."
msgstr ""
"*Xuíz da Nobreza* (en chinés: 天理, en pinyin: Tiān Lǐ) consta de 4 estrelas "
"no cazo da *Culler do Norte*. É unha prisión para nobres e tamén para "
"funcionarios encargados de facer cumprir a lei."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Excellencies
#. (In Purple Forbidden Enclosure)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Three
#. Excellencies (In Purple Forbidden Enclosure)
msgid ""
"*Three Excellencies* (Chinese: 三公, Pinyin: Sān Gōng) consists of 3 stars "
"south of the *Northern Dipper*'s handle. The *Three Excellencies* include "
"the *Grand Commandant*, *Minister over the Masses*, and *Minister of Works*,"
" the same as the *Three Top Instructors*, three highly respected official "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"As *Tres Excelencias* (en chinés: 三公, en pinyin: Sān Gōng) constan de 3 "
"estrelas ó sur do mango da *Culler do Norte*. As *Tres Excelencias* inclúen "
"o *Gran Comandante*, o *Ministro das Masas* e o *Ministro de Obras*, o mesmo"
" que os *Tres Instrutores Superiores*, tres cargos oficiais moi respectados."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Prime Minister
msgid ""
"*Prime Minister* (Chinese: 相, Pinyin: Xiàng) is 1 star south of the fourth "
"star of the *Northern Dipper*. It is the prime minister, assisting the "
"Emperor in managing state affairs, the highest administrative official under"
" the monarch, leading all officials and holding military power."
msgstr ""
"*Primeiro Ministro* (chinés: 相, pinyin: Xiàng) está a 1 estrela ó sur da "
"cuarta estrela da *Culler do Norte*. É o primeiro ministro, que axuda o "
"Emperador na xestión dos asuntos do Estado, o máximo funcionario "
"administrativo baixo o monarca, dirixindo todos os funcionarios e ostentando"
" o poder militar."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Guard of the Sun
msgid ""
"*Guard of the Sun* (Chinese: 太阳守, Pinyin: Tài Yáng Shǒu) is 1 star southwest"
" of the *Prime Minister*. It is a general responsible for garrison and "
"alert."
msgstr ""
"A *Garda do Sol* (en chinés: 太阳守, en pinyin: Tài Yáng Shǒu) está situada a 1"
" estrela ó suroeste do *Primeiro Ministro*. É un xeneral responsable da "
"gornición e da alerta."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Eunuch
msgid ""
"*Eunuch* (Chinese: 势, Pinyin: Shì) consists of 4 stars northwest of the "
"*Guard of the Sun*, officials who have been castrated, specifically eunuchs."
msgstr ""
"*Eunuco* (chinés: 势, pinyin: Shì) consta de 4 estrelas ó noroeste da *Garda "
"do Sol*, funcionarios que foron castrados, concretamente eunucos."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Sombre Lance
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Sombre
#. Lance
msgid ""
"*Sombre Lance* (Chinese: 玄戈, Pinyin: Xuán Gē) is 1 star north of the "
"*Twinkling Indicator*, close to the *Celestial Spear* and one end of the "
"*Northern Dipper*. This is a weapon, a halberd, the celestial lance or a "
"weapon used by northern nomadic tribes. It is used to divine whether "
"northern nomadic tribes will invade."
msgstr ""
"A *Lanza Sombría* (en chinés: 玄戈, en pinyin: Xuán Gē) atópase 1 estrela ó "
"norte do *Indicador Escintilante*, preto da *Lanza Celestial* e dun extremo "
"da *Culler do Norte*. Trátase dunha arma, unha alabarda, a lanza celestial "
"ou unha arma empregada polas tribos nómades do norte. Úsase para adiviñar se"
" as tribos nómades do norte invadirán."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Spear
msgid ""
"*Celestial Spear* (Chinese: 天枪, Pinyin: Tiān Qiāng) consists of 3 stars east"
" of the *Northern Dipper*'s handle. It is a weapon for defending the *Purple"
" Forbidden Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"A *Lanza Celestial* (en chinés: 天枪, en pinyin: Tiān Qiāng) consta de 3 "
"estrelas ó leste do mango da *Culler do norte*. É unha arma para defender o "
"*Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Flail
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Flail
msgid ""
"*Celestial Flail* (Chinese: 天棓, Pinyin: Tiān Bàng) consists of 5 stars "
"northeast of the *Woman's Bed*, a big stick, like the *Celestial Spear*, "
"also a defensive weapon."
msgstr ""
"O *Mallo Celestial* (en chinés: 天棓, en pinyin: Tiān Bàng) consta de 5 "
"estrelas ó nordeste da *Cama da Muller*, un pau grande, como a *Lanza "
"Celestial*, que tamén serve como arma defensiva."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Royals
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Royals
msgid ""
"*Royals* (Chinese: 太尊, Pinyin: Tài Zūn) is 1 star north of the *Middle "
"Step*. It represents royal relatives."
msgstr ""
"A *realeza* (en chinés: 太尊, en pinyin: Tài Zūn) está situada a 1 estrela ó "
"norte da *Escada do Medio*. Representa os parentes da realeza."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Supreme Palace
#. Enclosure
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Supreme
#. Palace Enclosure
msgid ""
"*Supreme Palace Enclosure* (Chinese: 太微垣, Pinyin: Tài Wēi Yuán) is the "
"Heavenly Court where the Heavenly Emperor handles government affairs, mainly"
" composed of various officials. The south gate is called the *Meridian "
"Gate*."
msgstr ""
"O *Recinto do Palacio Supremo* (en chinés: 太微垣, en pinyin: Tài Wēi Yuán) é a"
" Corte Celestial onde o Emperador Celestial se encarga dos asuntos "
"gobernamentais, composta principalmente por varios funcionarios. A porta sur"
" chámase *Porta Meridiana*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Supreme Palace
#. East Wall
msgid ""
"*Supreme Palace East Wall* (Chinese: 太微垣东蕃, Pinyin: Tài Wēi Yuán Dōng Fān) "
"consists of 5 stars, the left or eastern wall of the *Supreme Palace "
"Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"A *Muralla Leste do Palacio Supremo* (en chinés: 太微垣东蕃, en pinyin: Tài Wēi "
"Yuán Dōng Fān) consta de 5 estrelas, o muro esquerdo ou leste do *Recinto do"
" Palacio Supremo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Supreme Palace
#. West Wall
msgid ""
"*Supreme Palace West Wall* (Chinese: 太微垣西蕃, Pinyin: Tài Wēi Yuán Xī Fān) "
"consists of 5 stars, the right or western wall of the *Supreme Palace "
"Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"O *Muro Oeste do Palacio Supremo* (en chinés: 太微垣西蕃, en pinyin: Tài Wēi Yuán"
" Xī Fān) consta de 5 estrelas, a muralla dereita ou oeste do *Recinto do "
"Palacio Supremo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Seats of the Five
#. Emperors
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Seats of
#. the Five Emperors
msgid ""
"*Seats of the Five Emperors* (Chinese: 五帝座, Pinyin: Wǔ Dì Zuò) consists of 5"
" stars in the center of the *Supreme Palace Enclosure*, the seats of the "
"Five Emperors of the five directions. In the *Purple Forbidden Enclosure*, "
"there is also the *Interior Seats of the Five Emperors*. The central bright "
"star (β Leo) is the seat of Yellow Emperor, symbolizing the Son of Heaven."
msgstr ""
"*Os Asentos dos Cinco Emperadores* (en chinés: 五帝座, en pinyin: Wǔ Dì Zuò) "
"constan de 5 estrelas no centro do *Recinto do Palacio Supremo*, os asentos "
"dos Cinco Emperadores das cinco direccións. No *Recinto Púrpura Prohibido*, "
"tamén se atopan os *Asentos Interiores dos Cinco Emperadores*. A estrela "
"brillante central (β Leo) é o asento do Emperador Amarelo, simbolizando o "
"Fillo do Ceo."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Inner Screen
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Inner
#. Screen
msgid ""
"*Inner Screen* (Chinese: 内屏, Pinyin: Nèi Píng) consists of 4 stars inside "
"the *Meridian Gate*, near the south of the *Seats of the Five Emperors*, "
"close to the *Right Law Administrator* (β Vir)."
msgstr ""
"*Pantalla interior* (chinés: 内屏, pinyin: Nèi Píng) consta de 4 estrelas "
"dentro da *Porta do Meridiano*, preto do sur dos *Asentos dos Cinco "
"Emperadores*, preto do *Administrador da Lei Dereito* (β Vir)."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Usher to the Court
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Usher to
#. the Court
msgid ""
"*Usher to the Court* (Chinese: 谒者, Pinyin: Yè Zhě) is 1 star north of the "
"*Left Law Administrator* (η Vir)."
msgstr ""
"O *Uxier do Tribunal* (en chinés: 谒者, en pinyin: Yè Zhě) está situado a 1 "
"estrela ó norte do *Administrador da Lei da Esquerda* (η Vir)."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Excellencies
#. (In Supreme Palace Enclosure)
msgid ""
"*Three Excellencies* (Chinese: 三公, Pinyin: Sān Gōng) consists of 3 stars, "
"northeast of the *Usher to the Court*."
msgstr ""
"As *Tres Excelencias* (en chinés: 三公, en pinyin: Sān Gōng) constan de 3 "
"estrelas e están situadas ó nordeste do *Uxier da Corte*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Nine Senior
#. Officers
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Nine
#. Senior Officers
msgid ""
"*Nine Senior Officers* (Chinese: 九卿, Pinyin: Jiǔ Qīng) consists of 3 stars, "
"north of the *Three Excellencies*."
msgstr ""
"Os *Nove Oficiais Superiores* (en chinés: 九卿, en pinyin: Jiǔ Qīng) constan "
"de 3 estrelas, ó norte das *Tres Excelencias*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Five Lords
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Five Lords
msgid ""
"*Five Lords* (Chinese: 五诸侯, Pinyin: Wǔ Zhū Hóu) consists of 5 stars, south "
"of the *Officers of the Imperial Guard*."
msgstr ""
"Os *Cinco Señores* (en chinés: 五诸侯, en pinyin: Wǔ Zhū Hóu) constan de 5 "
"estrelas, situadas ó sur dos *Oficiais da Garda Imperial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Crown Prince
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Crown
#. Prince
msgid ""
"*Crown Prince* (Chinese: 太子, Pinyin: Tài Zǐ) is 1 star north of the *Seat of"
" Yellow Emperor*."
msgstr ""
"O *Príncipe Herdeiro* (en chinés: 太子, en pinyin: Tài Zǐ) está situado a 1 "
"estrela ó norte do *Asento do Emperador Amarelo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Retinue (In
#. Supreme Palace Enclosure)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Retinue
#. (In Supreme Palace Enclosure)
msgid ""
"*Retinue* (Chinese: 从官, Pinyin: Cóng Guān) is 1 star northwest of the *Crown"
" Prince*."
msgstr ""
"*O Séquito* (en chinés: 从官, en pinyin: Cóng Guān) está situado 1 estrela ó "
"noroeste do *Príncipe herdeiro*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Officer of Honour
msgid ""
"*Officer of Honour* (Chinese: 幸臣, Pinyin: Xìng Chén) is 1 star south of the "
"*Crown Prince*, northeast of the *Seats of the Five Emperors*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficial de Honra* (en chinés: 幸臣, en pinyin: Xìng Chén) está situado a 1 "
"estrela ó sur do *Príncipe Herdeiro* e ó nordés dos *Asentos dos Cinco "
"Emperadores*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Officers of the
#. Imperial Guard
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Officers
#. of the Imperial Guard
msgid ""
"*Officers of the Imperial Guard* (Chinese: 郎位, Pinyin: Láng Wèi) consists of"
" 15 stars, northeast of the *Seats of the Five Emperors*."
msgstr ""
"Os *Oficiais da Garda Imperial* (en chinés: 郎位, en pinyin: Láng Wèi) constan"
" de 15 estrelas, e están situados ó nordeste dos *Asentos dos Cinco "
"Emperadores*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Captain of the
#. Bodyguards
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Captain of
#. the Bodyguards
msgid ""
"*Captain of the Bodyguards* (Chinese: 郎将, Pinyin: Láng Jiàng) is 1 star "
"northeast of the *Officers of the Imperial Guard*."
msgstr ""
"O *Capitán dos Gardacostas* (en chinés: 郎将, en pinyin: Láng Jiàng) está "
"situado a 1 estrela ó nordeste dos *Oficiais da Garda Imperial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Royal Guards
msgid ""
"*Royal Guards* (Chinese: 常陈, Pinyin: Cháng Chén) consists of 7 stars north "
"of the *Seats of the Five Emperors*."
msgstr ""
"A *Garda Real* (en chinés: 常陈, en pinyin: Cháng Chén) consta de 7 estrelas ó"
" norte dos *Asentos dos Cinco Emperadores*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Emperor's
#. Bodyguard
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Emperor's
#. Bodyguard
msgid ""
"*Emperor's Bodyguard* (Chinese: 虎贲, Pinyin: Hǔ Bēn) is 1 star south of the "
"*Lower Step*."
msgstr ""
"O *Gardacostas do Emperador* (en chinés: 虎贲, en pinyin: Hǔ Bēn) está situada"
" a 1 estrela ó sur do *Chanzo Inferior*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Steps
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Three
#. Steps
msgid ""
"*Three Steps* (Chinese: 三台, Pinyin: Sān Tái) consists of 6 stars, the *Three"
" Steps* start from the *Administrative Center* and line up in the *Supreme "
"Palace Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"Os *Tres Chanzos* (en chinés: 三台, en pinyin: Sān Tái) constan de 6 estrelas."
" Os *Tres Chanzos* comezan no *Centro Administrativo* e aliñanse no *Recinto"
" do Palacio Supremo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Steps (Upper
#. Step)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Three
#. Steps (Upper Step)
msgid ""
"*Upper Step* (Chinese: 上台, Pinyin: Shàng Tái) as a part of the *Three "
"Steps*, consists of 2 stars."
msgstr ""
"O *Chanzo Superior* (en chinés: 上台, en pinyin: Shàng Tái) como parte dos "
"*Tres Chanzos*, consta de 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Steps
#. (Middle Step)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Three
#. Steps (Middle Step)
msgid ""
"*Middle Step* (Chinese: 中台, Pinyin: Zhōng Tái) as a part of the *Three "
"Steps*, consists of 2 stars."
msgstr ""
"*Chanzo do medio* (en chinés: 中台, en pinyin: Zhōng Tái) como parte dos *Tres"
" chanzos*, consta de 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Three Steps (Lower
#. Step)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Three
#. Steps (Lower Step)
msgid ""
"*Lower Step* (Chinese: 下台, Pinyin: Xià Tái) as a part of the *Three Steps*, "
"consists of 2 stars, north of the *Supreme Palace West Wall*."
msgstr ""
"O *Chanzo Inferior* (en chinés: 下台, en pinyin: Xià Tái) forma parte dos "
"*Tres Chanzos* e consta de 2 estrelas, e está situado ó norte do *Muro Oeste"
" do Palacio Supremo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Junior Officers
msgid ""
"*Junior Officers* (Chinese: 少微, Pinyin: Shǎo Wēi) consists of 4 stars, lined"
" up northwest of the *Supreme Palace Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficiais Subalternos* (en chinés: 少微, en pinyin: Shǎo Wēi) consta de 4 "
"estrelas, aliñadas ó noroeste do *Recinto do Palacio Supremo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Long Wall
msgid ""
"*Long Wall* (Chinese: 长垣, Pinyin: Cháng Yuán) consists of 4 stars south of "
"the *Junior Officers*."
msgstr ""
"*Muralla Longa* (en chinés: 长垣, en pinyin: Cháng Yuán) consta de 4 estrelas "
"ó sur dos *Oficiais Subalternos*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Astronomical
#. Observatory
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation
#. Astronomical Observatory
msgid ""
"*Astronomical Observatory* (Chinese: 灵台, Pinyin: Líng Tái) consists of 3 "
"stars west of the *Hall of Glory*."
msgstr ""
"O *Observatorio Astronómico* (en chinés: 灵台, en pinyin: Líng Tái) consta de "
"3 estrelas ó oeste do *Salón da Gloria*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation The Hall of Glory
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation The Hall
#. of Glory
msgid ""
"*The Hall of Glory* (Chinese: 明堂, Pinyin: Míng Táng) consists of 3 stars "
"outside the southwest corner of the *Supreme Palace Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"O *Salón da Gloria* (en chinés: 明堂, en pinyin: Míng Táng) consta de 3 "
"estrelas fóra da esquina suroeste do *Recinto do Palacio Supremo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Heavenly Market
#. Enclosure
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Heavenly
#. Market Enclosure
msgid ""
"*Heavenly Market Enclosure* (Chinese: 天市垣, Pinyin: Tiān Shì Yuán) is the "
"market in the sky."
msgstr ""
"O *Recinto do Mercado Celestial* (en chinés: 天市垣, en pinyin: Tiān Shì Yuán) "
"é o mercado no ceo."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Heavenly Market
#. East Wall
msgid ""
"*Heavenly Market East Wall* (Chinese: 天市垣东蕃, Pinyin: Tiān Shì Yuán Dōng Fān)"
" consists of 11 stars, the left or eastern wall of the *Heavenly Market "
"Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"O *Muro Leste do Mercado Celestial* (en chinés: 天市垣东蕃, en pinyin: Tiān Shì "
"Yuán Dōng Fān) consta de 11 estrelas, o muro esquerdo ou leste do *Recinto "
"do Mercado Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Heavenly Market
#. West Wall
msgid ""
"*Heavenly Market West Wall* (Chinese: 天市垣西蕃, Pinyin: Tiān Shì Yuán Xī Fān) "
"consists of 11 stars, the right or western wall of the *Heavenly Market "
"Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"O *Muro Oeste do Mercado Celestial* (en chinés: 天市垣西蕃, en pinyin: Tiān Shì "
"Yuán Xī Fān) consta de 11 estrelas, o muro dereito ou oeste do *Recinto do "
"Mercado Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Emperor's Seat
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Emperor's
#. Seat
msgid ""
"*Emperor's Seat* (Chinese: 帝座, Pinyin: Dì Zuò) is 1 star in the *Heavenly "
"Market Enclosure*, west of the *Astrologer*."
msgstr ""
"O *Asento do Emperador* (en chinés: 帝座, en pinyin: Dì Zuò) é unha estrela no"
" *Recinto do Mercado Celestial*, ó oeste do *Astrólogo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Astrologer
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Astrologer
#. Star
msgid ""
"*Astrologer* (Chinese: 候, Pinyin: Hòu) is 1 star northeast of the *Emperor's"
" Seat*."
msgstr ""
"*Astrólogo* (en chinés: 候, en pinyin: Hòu) está situado a 1 estrela ó "
"nordeste do *Asento do Emperador*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Eunuch Official
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Eunuch
#. Official
msgid ""
"*Eunuch Official* (Chinese: 宦者, Pinyin: Huàn Zhě) consists of 4 stars west "
"of the *Emperor's Seat*."
msgstr ""
"*Eunuco Oficial* (en chinés: 宦者, en pinyin: Huàn Zhě) consta de 4 estrelas ó"
" oeste do *Asento do Emperador*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official for the
#. Royal Clan
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Official
#. for the Royal Clan
msgid ""
"*Official for the Royal Clan* (Chinese: 宗正, Pinyin: Zōng Zhèng) consists of "
"2 stars southeast of the *Emperor's Seat*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficial para o Clan Real* (chinés: 宗正, pinyin: Zōng Zhèng) consta de 2 "
"estrelas ó sueste do *Asento do Emperador*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official of
#. Religious Ceremonies
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Official
#. of Religious Ceremonies
msgid ""
"*Official of Religious Ceremonies* (Chinese: 宗人, Pinyin: Zōng Rén) consists "
"of 4 stars east of the *Official for the Royal Clan*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficial de Cerimonias Relixiosas* (en chinés: 宗人, en pinyin: Zōng Rén) "
"consta de 4 estrelas ó leste do *Oficial do Clan Real*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Patriarchal Clan
#. Stars
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation
#. Patriarchal Clan Stars
msgid ""
"*Patriarchal Clan Stars* (Chinese: 宗星, Pinyin: Zōng Xīng) consists of 2 "
"stars north of the *Official of Religious Ceremonies*, east of the "
"*Astrologer*."
msgstr ""
"As *Estrelas do Clan Patriarcal* (en chinés: 宗星, en pinyin: Zōng Xīng) "
"constan de 2 estrelas ó norte do *Oficial de Cerimonias Relixiosas* e ó "
"leste do *Astrólogo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Municipal Office
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Municipal
#. Office
msgid ""
"*Municipal Office* (Chinese: 市楼, Pinyin: Shì Lóu) consists of 6 stars in the"
" market, above the *Winnowing Basket*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficina Municipal* (chinés: 市楼, pinyin: Shì Lóu) consta de 6 estrelas no "
"mercado, por riba da *Peneira*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Commodity Market
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Commodity
#. Market
msgid ""
"*Commodity Market* (Chinese: 车肆, Pinyin: Chē Sì) consists of 2 stars inside "
"the right star of the *Heavenly Market Enclosure* gate."
msgstr ""
"O *Mercado de Produtos Básicos* (en chinés: 车肆, en pinyin: Chē Sì) consta de"
" 2 estrelas dentro da estrela dereita da porta do *Recinto do Mercado "
"Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Dipper for Solids
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Dipper for
#. Solids
msgid ""
"*Dipper for Solids* (Chinese: 斛, Pinyin: Hú) consists of 4 stars in the "
"market, south of the *Dipper for Liquids*."
msgstr ""
"A *Culler para Sólidos* (en chinés: 斛, en pinyin: Hú) consta de 4 estrelas "
"no mercado, ó sur da *Culler para Líquidos*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Dipper for Liquids
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Dipper for
#. Liquids
msgid ""
"*Dipper for Liquids* (Chinese: 斗, Pinyin: Dǒu) consists of 5 stars southwest"
" of the *Eunuch Official*."
msgstr ""
"A *Culler para líquidos* (en chinés: 斗, en pinyin: Dǒu) consta de 5 estrelas"
" ó suroeste do *Eunuco oficial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Jewel Market
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Jewel
#. Market
msgid ""
"*Jewel Market* (Chinese: 列肆, Pinyin: Liè Sì) consists of 2 stars in the "
"*Heavenly Market Enclosure*, northwest of the *Dipper for Solids*."
msgstr ""
"O *Mercado de Xoias* (en chinés: 列肆, en pinyin: Liè Sì) consta de 2 estrelas"
" no *Recinto do Mercado Celestial*, ó noroeste da *Culler de Sólidos*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Textile Ruler
msgid ""
"*Textile Ruler* (Chinese: 帛度, Pinyin: Bó Dù) consists of 2 stars northeast "
"of the *Patriarchal Clan Stars*."
msgstr ""
"A *Regra Téxtil* (en chinés: 帛度, en pinyin: Bó Dù) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"nordeste das *Estrelas do Clan Patriarcal*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Butcher's Shops
msgid ""
"*Butcher's Shops* (Chinese: 屠肆, Pinyin: Tú Sì) consists of 2 stars north of "
"the *Textile Ruler*."
msgstr ""
"*Carnicerías* (en chinés: 屠肆, en pinyin: Tú Sì) consta de 2 estrelas ó norte"
" da *Regra Téxtil*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial
#. Discipline
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Discipline
msgid ""
"*Celestial Discipline* (Chinese: 天纪, Pinyin: Tiān Jì) consists of 9 stars "
"east of the *Coiled Thong*."
msgstr ""
"A *Disciplina Celestial* (en chinés: 天纪, en pinyin: Tiān Jì) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó leste da *Correa Enrolada*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Woman's Bed
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Woman's
#. Bed
msgid ""
"*Woman's Bed* (Chinese: 女床, Pinyin: Nǚ Chuáng) consists of 3 stars north of "
"the *Celestial Discipline*."
msgstr ""
"*Leito de muller* (en chinés: 女床, en pinyin: Nǚ Chuáng) consta de 3 estrelas"
" ó norte da *Disciplina Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Coiled Thong
msgid ""
"*Coiled Thong* (Chinese: 贯索, Pinyin: Guàn Suǒ) consists of 9 stars in front "
"of the *Seven Excellencies*."
msgstr ""
"*Correa Enrolada* (en chinés: 贯索, en pinyin: Guàn Suǒ) consta de 9 estrelas "
"diante das *Sete Excelencias*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Seven Excellencies
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Seven
#. Excellencies
msgid ""
"*Seven Excellencies* (Chinese: 七公, Pinyin: Qī Gōng) consists of 7 stars east"
" of the *Twinkling Indicator*."
msgstr ""
"As *Sete Excelencias* (en chinés: 七公, en pinyin: Qī Gōng) constan de 7 "
"estrelas ó leste do *Indicador Escintilante*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Horn
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Horn
msgid "*Horn* (Chinese: 角宿, Pinyin: Jiǎo Xiù) consists of 2 stars."
msgstr "*Corno* (en chinés: 角宿, en pinyin: Jiǎo Xiù) consta de 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Flat Road
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Flat Road
msgid ""
"*Flat Road* (Chinese: 平道, Pinyin: Píng Dào) consists of 2 stars beside the "
"*Left Horn* (α Vir) and the *Right Horn* (ζ Vir)."
msgstr ""
"*Estrada Plana* (en chinés: 平道, en pinyin: Píng Dào) consta de dúas estrelas"
" onda a *Corna Esquerda* (α Vir) e o *Corna Dereita* (ζ Vir)."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Recommending
#. Virtuous Men
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation
#. Recommending Virtuous Men
msgid ""
"*Recommending Virtuous Men* (Chinese: 进贤, Pinyin: Jìn Xián) is 1 star west "
"of the *Flat Road*."
msgstr ""
"*Recomendando Homes Virtuosos* (en chinés: 进贤, en pinyin: Jìn Xián) está a 1"
" estrela ó oeste da *Estrada Plana*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Farmland
#. (In Horn Mansion)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Farmland (In Horn Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Celestial Farmland* (Chinese: 天田, Pinyin: Tiān Tián) consists of 2 stars "
"north of the *Right Horn* (ζ Vir)."
msgstr ""
"*Terras de Cultivo Celestiais* (chinés: 天田, pinyin: Tiān Tián) consta de 2 "
"estrelas ó norte da *Corna Dereita* (ζ Vir)."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Tripod of the Zhou
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Tripod of
#. the Zhou
msgid ""
"*Tripod of the Zhou* (Chinese: 周鼎, Pinyin: Zhōu Dǐng) consists of 3 stars "
"west of the *Right Conductor*, above the *Horn Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"O *Trípode dos Zhou* (en chinés: 周鼎, en pinyin: Zhōu Dǐng) consta de 3 "
"estrelas ó oeste do *Condutor Dereito*, por riba da *Mansión dos Cornos*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Gate
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Gate
msgid ""
"*Celestial Gate* (Chinese: 天门, Pinyin: Tiān Mén) consists of 2 stars south "
"of the *Left Horn* (α Vir), north of the *Judging Stars*."
msgstr ""
"A *Porta Celestial* (en chinés: 天门, en pinyin: Tiān Mén) consta de 2 "
"estrelas ó sur da *Corna Esquerda* (α Vir), ó norte das *Estrelas do Xuízo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Judging Stars
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Judging
#. Stars
msgid ""
"*Judging Stars* (Chinese: 平星, Pinyin: Píng Xīng) consists of 2 stars north "
"of the *Arsenal*."
msgstr ""
"*Estrelas do Xuízo* (chinés: 平星, pinyin: Píng Xīng) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"norte do *Arsenal*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Arsenal
msgid ""
"*Arsenal* (Chinese: 库楼, Pinyin: Kù Lóu) consists of 10 stars south of the "
"*Horn Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Arsenal* (chinés: 库楼, pinyin: Kù Lóu) consta de 10 estrelas ó sur da "
"*Mansión dos Cornos*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Pillars (In Horn
#. Mansion)
msgid "*Pillars* (Chinese: 柱, Pinyin: Zhù) consists of 15 stars."
msgstr "*Piares* (en chinés: 柱, en pinyin: Zhù) constan de 15 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Railings
msgid "*Railings* (Chinese: 衡, Pinyin: Héng) consists of 4 stars."
msgstr "*Varandas* (en chinés: 衡, en pinyin: Héng) consta de 4 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Southern Gate
msgid ""
"*Southern Gate* (Chinese: 南门, Pinyin: Nán Mén) consists of 2 stars south of "
"the *Arsenal*."
msgstr ""
"A *Porta do Sur* (en chinés: 南门, en pinyin: Nán Mén) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"sur do *Arsenal*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Neck
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Neck
msgid "*Neck* (Chinese: 亢宿, Pinyin: Kàng Xiù) consists of 4 stars."
msgstr "*Pescozo* (en chinés: 亢宿, en pinyin: Kàng Xiù) ten 4 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Great Horn
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Great Horn
msgid ""
"*Great Horn* (Chinese: 大角, Pinyin: Dà Jiǎo) is 1 star between the left and "
"right *Conductors*."
msgstr ""
"*Gran Corno* (chinés: 大角, pinyin: Dà Jiǎo) é 1 estrela entre *Condutores* da"
" esquerda e da dereita."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Left Conductor
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Left
#. Conductor
msgid ""
"*Left Conductor* (Chinese: 左摄提, Pinyin: Zuǒ Shè Tí) consists of 3 stars. The"
" left and right *Conductors* sandwiching the *Great Horn*"
msgstr ""
"O *Condutor Esquerdo* (en chinés: 左摄提, en pinyin: Zuǒ Shè Tí) consta de 3 "
"estrelas. Os *Condutores* esquerdo e dereito rodean o *Gran Corno*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Right Conductor
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Right
#. Conductor
msgid ""
"*Right Conductor* (Chinese: 右摄提, Pinyin: Yòu Shè Tí) consists of 3 stars, "
"directly south of the handle of the *Northern Dipper*. The left and right "
"*Conductors* sandwiching the *Great Horn*"
msgstr ""
"O *Condutor Dereito* (en chinés: 右摄提, en pinyin: Yòu Shè Tí) consta de 3 "
"estrelas, situadas directamente ó sur do mango da *Culler do Norte*. Os "
"*Condutores* esquerdo e dereito rodean o *Gran Corno*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Executions
msgid ""
"*Executions* (Chinese: 折威, Pinyin: Zhé Wēi) consists of 7 stars south of the"
" *Neck Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Execucións* (en chinés: 折威, en pinyin: Zhé Wēi) consta de 7 estrelas ó sur "
"da *Mansión do Pescozo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Trials
msgid ""
"*Trials* (Chinese: 顿顽, Pinyin: Dùn Wán) consists of 2 stars southeast of the"
" *Executions*."
msgstr ""
"*Probas* (en chinés: 顿顽, en pinyin: Dùn Wán) consta de 2 estrelas ó sueste "
"das *Execucións*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Gate of Yang
msgid ""
"*Gate of Yang* (Chinese: 阳门, Pinyin: Yáng Mén) consists of 2 stars north of "
"the *Arsenal*."
msgstr ""
"*Porta de Yang* (chinés: 阳门, pinyin: Yáng Mén) consta de 2 estrelas ó norte "
"do *Arsenal*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Root
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Root
msgid "*Root* (Chinese: 氐宿, Pinyin: Dī Xiù) consists of 4 stars."
msgstr "*Raíz* (en chinés: 氐宿, en pinyin: Dī Xiù) consta de 4 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Lance
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Lance
msgid ""
"*Celestial Lance* (Chinese: 梗河, Pinyin: Gěng Hé) consists of 3 stars north "
"of the *Great Horn*, north of the *Mattress of the Emperor*."
msgstr ""
"*Lanza Celestial* (en chinés: 梗河, en pinyin: Gěng Hé) consta de 3 estrelas ó"
" norte do *Gran Corno*, ó norte do *Colchón do Emperador*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Twinkling
#. Indicator
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Twinkling
#. Indicator
msgid ""
"*Twinkling Indicator* (Chinese: 招摇, Pinyin: Zhāo Yáo) is 1 star north of the"
" *Celestial Lance*."
msgstr ""
"O *Indicador Escintilante* (en chinés: 招摇, en pinyin: Zhāo Yáo) está situado"
" a 1 estrela ó norte da *Lanza Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Mattress of the
#. Emperor
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Mattress
#. of the Emperor
msgid ""
"*Mattress of the Emperor* (Chinese: 帝席, Pinyin: Dì Xí) consists of 3 stars "
"east of the *Great Horn*."
msgstr ""
"O *Colchón do Emperador* (en chinés: 帝席, en pinyin: Dì Xí) consta de 3 "
"estrelas ó leste do *Gran Corno*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Boats and Lake
msgid ""
"*Boats and Lake* (Chinese: 亢池, Pinyin: Kàng Chí) consists of 6 stars north "
"of the *Neck Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Barcos e Lago* (en chinés: 亢池, en pinyin: Kàng Chí) consta de 6 estrelas ó "
"norte da *Mansión do Pescozo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Milk
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Milk
msgid ""
"*Celestial Milk* (Chinese: 天乳, Pinyin: Tiān Rǔ) is 1 star northeast of the "
"*Root Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Leite Celestial* (en chinés: 天乳, en pinyin: Tiān Rǔ) está a 1 estrela ó "
"nordeste da *Mansión da Raíz*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Battle Chariots
msgid ""
"*Battle Chariots* (Chinese: 阵车, Pinyin: Zhèn Chē) consists of 3 stars south "
"of the *Root Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Carros de Batalla* (en chinés: 阵车, en pinyin: Zhèn Chē) consta de 3 "
"estrelas ó sur da *Mansión da Raíz*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Spokes
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Spokes
msgid ""
"*Celestial Spokes* (Chinese: 天辐, Pinyin: Tiān Fú) consists of 2 stars, "
"diagonally lined west of the *Room Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Raios Celestes* (en chinés: 天辐, en pinyin: Tiān Fú) consta de 2 estrelas, "
"aliñadas diagonalmente ó oeste da *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Imperial Guards
msgid ""
"*Imperial Guards* (Chinese: 骑官, Pinyin: Qí Guān) consists of 27 stars south "
"of the *Root Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"A *Garda Imperial* (en chinés: 骑官, en pinyin: Qí Guān) consta de 27 estrelas"
" ó sur da *Mansión da Raíz*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Chariots and
#. Cavalry
msgid ""
"*Chariots and Cavalry* (Chinese: 车骑, Pinyin: Chē Qí) consists of 3 stars "
"south of the *Imperial Guards*."
msgstr ""
"*Carros e Cabalería* (en chinés: 车骑, en pinyin: Chē Qí) consta de 3 estrelas"
" ó sur da *Garda Imperial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Chariots and
#. Cavalry General
msgid ""
"*Chariots and Cavalry General* (Chinese: 骑阵将军, Pinyin: Qí Zhèn Jiāng Jūn) is"
" 1 star at the eastern end of the *Imperial Guards*."
msgstr ""
"*Xeneral de Carros e Cabalería* (chinés: 骑阵将军, pinyin: Qí Zhèn Jiāng Jūn) é "
"1 estrela no extremo leste da *Garda Imperial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Room
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Room
msgid "*Room* (Chinese: 房宿, Pinyin: Fáng Xiù) consists of 4 stars."
msgstr "*Habitación* (chinés: 房宿, pinyin: Fáng Xiù) consta de 4 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Lock (Vassal of
#. Room)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Lock
#. (Vassal of Room)
msgid ""
"*Lock* (Chinese: 钩钤, Pinyin: Gōu Qián) consists of 2 stars north of the "
"*Room Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Pechadura* (en chinés: 钩钤, en pinyin: Gōu Qián) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"norte da *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Door Bolt
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Door Bolt
msgid ""
"*Door Bolt* (Chinese: 键闭, Pinyin: Jiàn Bì) is 1 star northeast of the *Room "
"Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"A *Manilla da porta* (en chinés: 键闭, en pinyin: Jiàn Bì) está situado a 1 "
"estrela ó nordeste da *Mansión Room*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Punishment
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Punishment
msgid ""
"*Punishment* (Chinese: 罚, Pinyin: Fá) consists of 3 stars west of the "
"*Eastern Door*, lined north-south."
msgstr ""
"*Castigo* (en chinés: 罚, en pinyin: Fá) consta de 3 estrelas ó oeste da "
"*Porta Oriental*, aliñadas de norte a sur."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Eastern Door
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Eastern
#. Door
msgid ""
"*Eastern Door* (Chinese: 东咸, Pinyin: Dōng Xián) consists of 4 stars "
"northeast of the *Room Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"A *Porta Oriental* (en chinés: 东咸, en pinyin: Dōng Xián) consta de 4 "
"estrelas ó nordeste da *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Western Door
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Western
#. Door
msgid ""
"*Western Door* (Chinese: 西咸, Pinyin: Xī Xián) consists of 4 stars north of "
"the *Room Mansion*."
msgstr ""
" *Porta Occidental* (en chinés: 西咸, en pinyin: Xī Xián) consta de 4 estrelas"
" ó norte da *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Solar Star
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Solar Star
msgid ""
"*Solar Star* (Chinese: 日, Pinyin: Rì) is 1 star in the middle path of the "
"*Room Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Estrela Solar* (en chinés: 日, en pinyin: Rì) é unha estrela situada no "
"medio da *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Retinue (In Room
#. Mansion)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Retinue
#. (In Room Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Retinue* (Chinese: 从官, Pinyin: Cóng Guān) consists of 2 stars south of the "
"*Room Mansion* stars."
msgstr ""
"*A comitiva* (en chinés: 从官, en pinyin: Cóng Guān) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"sur das estrelas *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Heart
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Heart
msgid "*Heart* (Chinese: 心宿, Pinyin: Xīn Xiù) consists of 3 stars."
msgstr "*Corazón* (en chinés: 心宿, en pinyin: Xīn Xiù) consta de 3 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Group of Soldiers
msgid ""
"*Group of Soldiers* (Chinese: 积卒, Pinyin: Jī Zú) consists of 12 stars south "
"of the *Room Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Grupo de Soldados* (en chinés: 积卒, en pinyin: Jī Zú) consta de 12 estrelas "
"ó sur da *Mansión da Habitación*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Tail
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Tail
msgid "*Tail* (Chinese: 尾宿, Pinyin: Wěi Xiù) consists of 9 stars."
msgstr "*Rabo* (en chinés: 尾宿, en pinyin: Wěi Xiù) consta de 9 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Changing Room
#. (Vassal of Tail)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Changing
#. Room (Vassal of Tail)
msgid ""
"*Changing Room* (Chinese: 神宫, Pinyin: Shén Gōng) is 1 star beside the second"
" star of the *Tail Mansion* (μ1 Sco)."
msgstr ""
"*Vestiario* (en chinés: 神宫, en pinyin: Shén Gōng) ten 1 estrela xunto á "
"segunda estrela da *Mansión do Rabo* (μ1 Sco)."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial River
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. River
msgid ""
"*Celestial River* (Chinese: 天江, Pinyin: Tiān Jiāng) consists of 4 stars "
"north of the *Tail Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Río Celestial* (en chinés: 天江, en pinyin: Tiān Jiāng) consta de 4 estrelas "
"ó norte da *Mansión do Rabo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Fu Yue
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Fu Yue
msgid ""
"*Fu Yue* (Chinese: 傅说, Pinyin: Fù Yuè) is 1 star behind the *Tail Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Fu Yue* (Chinese: 傅说, Pinyin: Fù Yuè) é unha esstrela detrás da *Mansión do"
" Rabo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Fish
msgid ""
"*Fish* (Chinese: 鱼, Pinyin: Yú) is 1 star in the milky way behind the *Tail "
"Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Peixe* (en chinés: 鱼, en pinyin: Yú) está a 1 estrela na Vía Láctea, detrás"
" da *Mansión do Rabo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Tortoise
msgid ""
"*Tortoise* (Chinese: 龟, Pinyin: Guī) consists of 5 stars south of the *Tail "
"Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Tartaruga* (en chinés: 龟, en pinyin: Guī) consta de 5 estrelas ó sur da "
"*Mansión do Rabo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Winnowing Basket
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Winnowing
#. Basket
msgid "*Winnowing Basket* (Chinese: 箕宿, Pinyin: Jī Xiù) consists of 4 stars."
msgstr "*Peneira* (en chinés: 箕宿, en pinyin: Jī Xiù) ten 4 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Chaff
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Chaff Star
msgid ""
"*Chaff* (Chinese: 糠, Pinyin: Kāng) is 1 star in front of the *Winnowing "
"Basket Mansion*'s tongue, northwest of the *Pestle*."
msgstr ""
"*Palla* (en chinés: 糠, en pinyin: Kāng) está situada 1 estrela diante da "
"lingua da *Mansión do Cribado*, ó noroeste da *Maza*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Pestle (In
#. Winnowing Basket Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Pestle* (Chinese: 杵, Pinyin: Chǔ) consists of 3 stars south of the "
"*Winnowing Basket Mansion*."
msgstr ""
"*Maza* (en chinés: 杵, en pinyin: Chǔ) consta de 3 estrelas ó sur da *Mansión"
" da Peneira*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Dipper
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Dipper
msgid ""
"*Dipper* (Chinese: 斗宿, Pinyin: Dǒu Xiù) or *Southern Dipper*, consists of 6 "
"stars."
msgstr ""
"*Culler* (chinés: 斗宿, pinyin: Dǒu Xiù) ou *Culler do Sur*, consta de 6 "
"estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Establishment
#. Stars
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation
#. Establishment Stars
msgid ""
"*Establishment Stars* (Chinese: 建星, Pinyin: Jiàn Xīng) consists of 6 stars "
"north of the *Southern Dipper*."
msgstr ""
"As *Estrelas do Establecemento* (en chinés: 建星, en pinyin: Jiàn Xīng) "
"constan de 6 estrelas ó norte da *Culler do Sur*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Market Officer
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Market
#. Officer
msgid ""
"*Market Officer* (Chinese: 天弁, Pinyin: Tiān Biàn) consists of 9 stars north "
"of the *Establishment Stars*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficial de mercado* (en chinés: 天弁, en pinyin: Tiān Biàn) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó norte das *Estrelas do Establecemento*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Keyhole
msgid ""
"*Celestial Keyhole* (Chinese: 天籥, Pinyin: Tiān Yuè) consists of 8 stars west"
" of the second star of the *Southern Dipper*'s handle."
msgstr ""
"*O Burato da Fechadura Celestial* (en chinés: 天籥, en pinyin: Tiān Yuè) "
"consta de 8 estrelas ó oeste da segunda estrela do mango da *Culler do Sur*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Peasant
msgid ""
"*Peasant* (Chinese: 农丈人, Pinyin: Nóng Zhàng Rén) is 1 star southwest of the "
"*Southern Dipper*."
msgstr ""
"*Labrego* ( chinés : 农丈人 , pinyin : Nóng Zhàng Rén ) é 1 estrela ó suroeste "
"da *Culler do sur *."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Dog
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Dog Stars
msgid "*Dog* (Chinese: 狗, Pinyin: Gǒu) consists of 2 stars."
msgstr "*Can* (en chinés: 狗, en pinyin: Gǒu) ten 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Cock
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Cock
msgid ""
"*Celestial Cock* (Chinese: 天鸡, Pinyin: Tiān Jī) consists of 2 stars north of"
" the *Territory of Dog*, west of the *Ox*."
msgstr ""
"O *Galo Celestial* (en chinés: 天鸡, en pinyin: Tiān Jī) consta de 2 estrelas "
"ó norte do *Territorio do Can*, ó oeste do *Boi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Territory of Dog
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Territory
#. of Dog
msgid ""
"Territory of Dog (Chinese: 狗国, Pinyin: Gǒu Guó) consists of 4 stars "
"southeast of the *Establishment Stars*."
msgstr ""
"O Territorio do Can (en chinés: 狗国, en pinyin: Gǒu Guó) consta de 4 estrelas"
" ó sueste das *Estrelas do Establecemento*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation River Turtle
msgid ""
"*River Turtle* (Chinese: 鳖, Pinyin: Biē) consists of 14 stars south of the "
"*Dipper*."
msgstr ""
"*Tartaruga de Río* (en chinés: 鳖, en pinyin: Biē) consta de 14 estrelas ó "
"sur da *Culler*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Spring
msgid ""
"*Celestial Spring* (Chinese: 天渊, Pinyin: Tiān Yuān) consists of 10 stars "
"southeast of the *River Turtle*, between the *River Turtle* and the *Nine "
"Water Wells*."
msgstr ""
"*Fonte Celestial* (en chinés: 天渊, en pinyin: Tiān Yuān) consta de 10 "
"estrelas ó sueste da *Tartaruga de Río*, entre a *Tartaruga de Río* e os "
"*Nove Pozos de Auga*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Ox
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Ox
msgid "*Ox* (Chinese: 牛宿, Pinyin: Niú Xiù) consists of 6 stars."
msgstr "*Boi* (en chinés: 牛宿, en pinyin: Niú Xiù) consta de 6 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial
#. Drumstick
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Drumstick
msgid ""
"*Celestial Drumstick* (Chinese: 天桴, Pinyin: Tiān Fú) consists of 4 stars "
"lined horizontally north of the *Ox*."
msgstr ""
"*Baqueta celestial* (en chinés: 天桴, en pinyin: Tiān Fú) consta de 4 estrelas"
" aliñadas horizontalmente ó norte do *Boi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Drum at the River
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Drum at
#. the River
msgid ""
"*Drum at the River* (Chinese: 河鼓, Pinyin: Hé Gǔ) consists of 3 stars "
"northwest of the *Ox*."
msgstr ""
"*Tambor no río* (en chinés: 河鼓, en pinyin: Hé Gǔ) consta de 3 estrelas ó "
"noroeste do *Boi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Right Flag
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Right Flag
msgid ""
"*Right Flag* (Chinese: 右旗, Pinyin: Yòu Qí) consists of 9 stars north of the "
"*Ox*, southwest of the *Drum at the River*."
msgstr ""
"A *Bandeira da Dereita* (en chinés: 右旗, en pinyin: Yòu Qí) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó norte do *Boi*, ó suroeste do *Tambor no Río*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Left Flag
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Left Flag
msgid ""
"*Left Flag* (Chinese: 左旗, Pinyin: Zuǒ Qí) consists of 9 stars beside the "
"left of the *Drum at the River*."
msgstr ""
"A *Bandeira da Esquerda* (en chinés: 左旗, en pinyin: Zuǒ Qí) consta de 9 "
"estrelas á esquerda do *Tambor no Río*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Clepsydra Terrace
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Clepsydra
#. Terrace
msgid ""
"*Clepsydra Terrace* (Chinese: 渐台, Pinyin: Jiàn Tái) consists of 4 stars "
"southeast of the *Weaving Girl*."
msgstr ""
"*A Terraza da Clepsidra* (en chinés: 渐台, en pinyin: Jiàn Tái) consta de 4 "
"estrelas ó sueste da *Tecelá*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Imperial
#. Passageway
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Imperial
#. Passageway
msgid ""
"*Imperial Passageway* (Chinese: 辇道, Pinyin: Niǎn Dào) consists of 5 stars "
"northeast of the *Clepsydra Terrace*."
msgstr ""
"A *Pasaxe Imperial* (en chinés: 辇道, en pinyin: Niǎn Dào) consta de 5 "
"estrelas ó nordeste da *Terraza da Clepsidra*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Weaving Girl
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Weaving
#. Girl
msgid ""
"*Weaving Girl* (Chinese: 织女, Pinyin: Zhī Nǚ) consists of 3 stars at the "
"eastern end of the *Celestial Discipline*, northeast of the *Heavenly Market"
" Enclosure*."
msgstr ""
"*Tecelá* (en chinés: 织女, en pinyin: Zhī Nǚ) consta de 3 estrelas no extremo "
"leste da *Disciplina Celestial*, ó nordeste do *Recinto do Mercado "
"Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Network of Dykes
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Network of
#. Dykes
msgid ""
"*Network of Dykes* (Chinese: 罗堰, Pinyin: Luó Yàn) consists of 3 stars east "
"of the *Ox*."
msgstr ""
"A *Rede de Diques* (en chinés: 罗堰, en pinyin: Luó Yàn) consta de 3 estrelas "
"ó leste do *Boi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Farmland
#. (In Horn Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Celestial Farmland* (Chinese: 天田, Pinyin: Tiān Tián) consists of 9 stars "
"south of the *Ox*."
msgstr ""
"*Terras de Cultivo Celestiais* (chinés: 天田, pinyin: Tiān Tián) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó sur do *Boi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Nine Water Wells
msgid ""
"*Nine Water Wells* (Chinese: 九坎, Pinyin: Jiǔ Kǎn) consists of 9 stars south "
"of the *Ox*."
msgstr ""
"*Nove Pozos de Auga* (en chinés: 九坎, en pinyin: Jiǔ Kǎn) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó sur do *Boi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Girl
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Girl
msgid "*Girl* (Chinese: 女宿, Pinyin: Nǚ Xiù) consists of 4 stars."
msgstr "*Rapariga* (en chinés: 女宿, en pinyin: Nǚ Xiù) ten 4 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Pearls on Ladies'
#. Wear
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Pearls on
#. Ladies' Wear
msgid ""
"*Pearls on Ladies' Wear* (Chinese: 离珠, Pinyin: Lí Zhū) consists of 5 stars "
"north of the *Girl*."
msgstr ""
"*Perlas nunha Muller* (en chinés: 离珠, en pinyin: Lí Zhū) consta de 5 "
"estrelas ó norte da *Rapariga*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Rotten Gourd
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Rotten
#. Gourd
msgid ""
"*Rotten Gourd* (Chinese: 败瓜, Pinyin: Bài Guā) consists of 5 stars beside the"
" *Good Gourd*."
msgstr ""
"*Cabaza podre* (en chinés: 败瓜, en pinyin: Bài Guā) consta de 5 estrelas "
"xunto á *Cabaza Boa*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Good Gourd
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Good Gourd
msgid ""
"*Good Gourd* (Chinese: 瓠瓜, Pinyin: Hù Guā) consists of 5 stars north of the "
"*Pearls on Ladies' Wear*."
msgstr ""
"*Cabaza Boa* (en chinés: 瓠瓜, en pinyin: Hù Guā) consta de 5 estrelas ó norte"
" das *Perlas nunha Muller*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Ford
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Ford
msgid ""
"*Celestial Ford* (Chinese: 天津, Pinyin: Tiān Jīn) consists of 9 stars in the "
"milky way north of the *Good Gourd*."
msgstr ""
"*Vao Celestial* (en chinés: 天津, en pinyin: Tiān Jīn) consta de 9 estrelas na"
" Vía Láctea ó norte da *Cabaza Boa*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Xi Zhong
msgid ""
"*Xi Zhong* (Chinese: 奚仲, Pinyin: Xī Zhòng) consists of 4 stars, shaped like "
"the *Railings* constellation, north of the *Celestial Ford*."
msgstr ""
"*Xi Zhong* (en chinés: 奚仲, en pinyin: Xī Zhòng) consta de 4 estrelas, coa "
"forma da constelación das *Varandas*, situadas ó norte do *Vao Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Basket for
#. Mulberry Leaves
msgid ""
"Basket for Mulberry Leaves (Chinese: 扶筐, Pinyin: Fú Kuāng) consists of 7 "
"stars north of the Celestial Ford."
msgstr ""
"Cesta para Follas de Moreira (en chinés: 扶筐, en pinyin: Fú Kuāng) consta de "
"7 estrelas ó norte do Vao Celestial."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Twelve States
msgid ""
"*Twelve States* (Chinese: 十二国, Pinyin: Shí èr Guó) consists of 16 stars."
msgstr ""
"*Doce Estados* (chinés: 十二国, pinyin: Shí èr Guó) consta de 16 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Yue State
msgid ""
"*Yue State* (Chinese: 越, Pinyin: Yuè) is 1 star north of *Zheng State*."
msgstr ""
"*Êstado de Yue* (en chinés: 越, en pinyin: Yuè) está situado a 1 estrela ó "
"norte do *Estado de Zheng*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Zheng State
msgid ""
"*Zheng State* (Chinese: 郑, Pinyin: Zhèng) is 1 star north of *Zhao State*."
msgstr ""
"*Estado de Zheng* (en chinés: 郑, en pinyin: Zhèng) está situado a 1 estrela "
"ó norte do *Estado de Zhao*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Zhao State
msgid ""
"*Zhao State* (Chinese: 赵, Pinyin: Zhào) consists of 2 stars north of *Qi "
"State*."
msgstr ""
"*Estado de Zhao* (en chinés: 赵, en pinyin: Zhào) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"norte do *Estado de Qi*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Qi State
msgid ""
"*Qi State* (Chinese: 齐, Pinyin: Qí) is 1 star east of the *Nine Water "
"Wells*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado de Qi* (en chinés: 齐, en pinyin: Qí) está situado a 1 estrela ó "
"leste dos *Nove Pozos de Auga*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Zhou State
msgid ""
"*Zhou State* (Chinese: 周, Pinyin: Zhōu) consists of 2 stars east of *Yue "
"State*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado de Zhou* (en chinés: 周, en pinyin: Zhōu) consta de 2 estrelas ó "
"leste do *Estado de Yue*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Qin State
msgid ""
"*Qin State* (Chinese: 秦, Pinyin: Qín) consists of 2 stars, lined north-south"
" southeast of *Zhou*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado de Qin* (en chinés: 秦, en pinyin: Qín) consta de dúas estrelas, "
"aliñadas de norte a sur e sueste de *Zhou*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Dai State
msgid ""
"*Dai State* (Chinese: 代, Pinyin: Dài) consists of 2 stars south of *Qin "
"State*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado de Dai* (en chinés: 代, en pinyin: Dài) consta de 2 estrelas ó sur "
"do *Estado de Qin*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Jin State
msgid "*Jin State* (Chinese: 晋, Pinyin: Jìn) is 1 star west of *Dai State*."
msgstr ""
"*Estado de Jin* (chinés: 晋, pinyin: Jìn) é 1 estrela ó oeste de *Estado de "
"Dai*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Han State
msgid "*Han State* (Chinese: 韩, Pinyin: Hán) is 1 star north of *Jin State*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado Han* (en chinés: 韩, en pinyin: Hán) está situado a 1 estrela ó "
"norte do *Estado Jin*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Wei State
msgid "*Wei State* (Chinese: 魏, Pinyin: Wèi) is 1 star north of *Han State*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado de Wei* (en chinés: 魏, en pinyin: Wèi) está situado a 1 estrela ó "
"norte do *Estado de Han*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Chu State
msgid "*Chu State* (Chinese: 楚, Pinyin: Chǔ) is 1 star west of *Wei State*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estado de Chu* (en chinés: 楚, en pinyin: Chǔ) está situado a 1 estrela ób"
" oeste do *Estado de Wei*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Yan State
msgid "*Yan State* (Chinese: 燕, Pinyin: Yàn) is 1 star south of *Chu State*."
msgstr ""
"*Estado de Yan* (chinés: 燕, pinyin: Yàn) é 1 estrela ó sur do *Estado de "
"Chu*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Emptiness
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Emptiness
msgid "*Emptiness* (Chinese: 虚宿, Pinyin: Xū Xiù) consists of 2 stars."
msgstr "*Baleiro* (en chinés: 虚宿, en pinyin: Xū Xiù) consta de 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Deified Judge of
#. Life
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Deified
#. Judge of Life
msgid ""
"*Deified Judge of Life* (Chinese: 司命, Pinyin: Sī Mìng) consists of 2 stars "
"north of the *Emptiness*."
msgstr ""
"*Xuíz Deificado da Vida* (en chinés: 司命, en pinyin: Sī Mìng) consta de 2 "
"estrelas ó norte do *Baleiro*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Deified Judge of
#. Rank
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Deified
#. Judge of Rank
msgid ""
"*Deified Judge of Rank* (Chinese: 司禄, Pinyin: Sī Lù) consists of 2 stars "
"north of the *Deified Judge of Life*."
msgstr ""
"*Xuíz de Rango Deificado* (en chinés: 司禄, en pinyin: Sī Lù) consta de 2 "
"estrelas ó norte do *Xuíz de Vida Deificado*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Deified Judge of
#. Disaster and Good Fortune
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Deified
#. Judge of Disaster and Good Fortune
msgid ""
"*Deified Judge of Disaster and Good Fortune* (Chinese: 司危, Pinyin: Sī Wēi) "
"consists of 2 stars north of the *Deified Judge of Rank*."
msgstr ""
"*Xuíz Deificado do Desastre e da Boa Fortuna* (en chinés: 司危, en pinyin: Sī "
"Wēi) consta de 2 estrelas ó norte do *Xuíz de Rango Deificado*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Deified Judge of
#. Right and Wrong
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Deified
#. Judge of Right and Wrong
msgid ""
"*Deified Judge of Right and Wrong* (Chinese: 司非, Pinyin: Sī Fēi) consists of"
" 2 stars north of the *Deified Judge of Disaster and Good Fortune*."
msgstr ""
"*Xuíz Divinizado do Ben e do Mal* (en chinés: 司非, en pinyin: Sī Fēi) consta "
"de 2 estrelas ó norte do *Xuíz Deificado do Desastre e da Boa Fortuna*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Crying
msgid ""
"*Crying* (Chinese: 哭, Pinyin: Kū) consists of 2 stars south of the "
"*Emptiness*."
msgstr ""
"*Choro* (en chinés: 哭, en pinyin: Kū) consta de 2 estrelas ó sur do "
"*Baleiro*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Weeping
msgid ""
"*Weeping* (Chinese: 泣, Pinyin: Qì) consists of 2 stars east of the *Crying*."
msgstr ""
"*Pranto* (en chinés: 泣, en pinyin: Qì) consta de 2 estrelas ó leste do "
"*Choro*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Ramparts
msgid ""
"*Celestial Ramparts* (Chinese: 天垒城, Pinyin: Tiān Lěi Chéng) consists of 12 "
"stars south of the *Crying* and *Weeping*."
msgstr ""
"*Murallas Celestiais* (en chinés: 天垒城, en pinyin: Tiān Lěi Chéng) consta de "
"12 estrelas ó sur do *Choro* e do *Pranto*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Decayed Mortar
msgid ""
"*Decayed Mortar* (Chinese: 败臼, Pinyin: Bài Jiù) consists of 4 stars south of"
" the *Emptiness* and *Rooftop*."
msgstr ""
"*Morteiro Deteriorado* (en chinés: 败臼, en pinyin: Bài Jiù) consta de 4 "
"estrelas ó sur do *Baleiro* e da *Azotea*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Jade Ornament on
#. Ladies' Wear
msgid ""
"*Jade Ornament on Ladies' Wear* (Chinese: 离瑜, Pinyin: Lí Yú) consists of 3 "
"stars, lined north-south southeast of *Qin State* and *Dai State*."
msgstr ""
"*Ornamento de Xade nunha Muller* (en chinés: 离瑜, en pinyin: Lí Yú) consta de"
" 3 estrelas, aliñadas de norte a sur e sueste entre o *Estado de Qin* e o "
"*Estado de Dai*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Rooftop
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Rooftop
msgid ""
"*Rooftop* (Chinese: 危宿, Pinyin: Wēi Xiù) consists of 3 stars southeast of "
"the *Celestial Ford*."
msgstr ""
"*Azotea* (en chinés: 危宿, en pinyin: Wēi Xiù) consta de 3 estrelas ó sueste "
"do *Vao Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Tomb (Vassal of
#. Rooftop)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Tomb
#. (Vassal of Rooftop)
msgid ""
"*Tomb* (Chinese: 坟墓, Pinyin: Fén Mù) consists of 4 stars south of the "
"*Rooftop*."
msgstr ""
"*Tumba* (en chinés: 坟墓, en pinyin: Fén Mù) consta de 4 estrelas ó sur da "
"*Azotea*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Humans Stars
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Humans
#. Stars
msgid ""
"*Humans Stars* (Chinese: 人星, Pinyin: Rén Xīng) consists of 5 stars southeast"
" of the *Big Yard for Chariots*, north of the *Emptiness*."
msgstr ""
"*Estrelas Humanas* (en chinés: 人星, en pinyin: Rén Xīng) consta de 5 estrelas"
" ó sueste do *Gran Patio de Carros*, ó norte do *Baleiro*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Pestle (In Rooftop
#. Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Pestle* (Chinese: 杵, Pinyin: Chǔ) consists of 3 stars east of the *Humans "
"Stars*, beside the milky way."
msgstr ""
"*Pailán* (en chinés: 杵, en pinyin: Chǔ) consta de 3 estrelas ó leste das "
"*Estrelas Humanas*, onda a Vía Láctea."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Mortar
msgid ""
"*Mortar* (Chinese: 臼, Pinyin: Jiù) consists of 4 stars east of the *Humans "
"Stars*, under the *Pestle* stars."
msgstr ""
"*Morteiro* (en chinés: 臼, en pinyin: Jiù) consta de 4 estrelas ó leste das "
"*Estrelas Humanas*, baixo as estrelas *Pailán*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Big Yard for
#. Chariots
msgid ""
"*Big Yard for Chariots* (Chinese: 车府, Pinyin: Chē Fǔ) consists of 7 stars "
"east of the *Celestial Ford*, near the milky way, lined east-west."
msgstr ""
"O *Gran Patio de Carros* (en chinés: 车府, en pinyin: Chē Fǔ) consta de 7 "
"estrelas ó leste do *Vao Celestial*, preto da Vía Láctea, aliñadas de leste "
"a oeste."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Zaofu
msgid ""
"*Zaofu* (Chinese: 造父, Pinyin: Zào Fù) consists of 5 stars south of the "
"*Celestial Hook*, in the milky way."
msgstr ""
"*Zaofu* (en chinés: 造父, en pinyin: Zào Fù) consta de 5 estrelas ó sur do "
"*Gancho Celestial*, na Vía Láctea."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Hook
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Hook
msgid ""
"*Celestial Hook* (Chinese: 天钩, Pinyin: Tiān Gōu) consists of 9 stars north "
"of *Zaofu*."
msgstr ""
"*Gancho Celestial* (en chinés: 天钩, en pinyin: Tiān Gōu) consta de 9 estrelas"
" ó norte de *Zaofu*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Roofing
msgid ""
"*Roofing* (Chinese: 盖屋, Pinyin: Gài Wū) consists of 2 stars south of the "
"*Rooftop*."
msgstr ""
"*Teito* (en chinés: 盖屋, en pinyin: Gài Wū) consta de 2 estrelas ó sur da "
"*Azotea*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Temple
msgid ""
"*Temple* (Chinese: 虚梁, Pinyin: Xū Liáng) consists of 4 stars south of the "
"*Rooftop*."
msgstr ""
"O *Templo* (en chinés: 虚梁, en pinyin: Xū Liáng) consta de 4 estrelas ó sur "
"da *Azotea*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Money
msgid ""
"*Celestial Money* (Chinese: 天钱, Pinyin: Tiān Qián) consists of 10 stars "
"northwest of the *North Gate of the Military Camp*."
msgstr ""
"O *Diñeiro Celestial* (en chinés: 天钱, en pinyin: Tiān Qián) consta de 10 "
"estrelas ó noroeste da *Porta Norte do Campamento Militar*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Encampment
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Encampment
msgid "*Encampment* (Chinese: 室宿, Pinyin: Shì Xiù) consists of 2 stars."
msgstr ""
"*Campamento* (en chinés: 室宿, en pinyin: Shì Xiù) consta de 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Resting Palace
#. (Vassal of Encampment)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Resting
#. Palace (Vassal of Encampment)
msgid "*Resting Palace* (Chinese: 离宫, Pinyin: Lí Gōng) consists of 6 stars."
msgstr ""
"O *Palacio de Descanso* (en chinés: 离宫, en pinyin: Lí Gōng) consta de 6 "
"estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Flying Serpent
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Flying
#. Serpent
msgid ""
"*Flying Serpent* (Chinese: 螣蛇, Pinyin: Téng Shé) consists of 22 stars north "
"of the *Encampment*."
msgstr ""
"A *Serpe Voadora* (en chinés: 螣蛇, en pinyin: Téng Shé) consta de 22 estrelas"
" ó norte do *Campamento*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Thunder and
#. Lightning
msgid ""
"*Thunder and Lightning* (Chinese: 雷电, Pinyin: Léi Diàn) consists of 6 stars "
"southwest of the *Encampment*."
msgstr ""
"*Trono e Lóstrego* (en chinés: 雷电, en pinyin: Léi Diàn) consta de 6 estrelas"
" ó suroeste do *Campamento*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official for
#. Materials Supply
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Official
#. for Materials Supply
msgid ""
"*Official for Materials Supply* (Chinese: 土公吏, Pinyin: Tǔ Gōng Lì) consists "
"of 2 stars southwest of the *Encampment*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficial de Subministración de Materiais* (en chinés: 土公吏, en pinyin: Tǔ "
"Gōng Lì) consta de 2 estrelas ó suroeste do *Campamento*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Palace Guard
msgid ""
"*Palace Guard* (Chinese: 羽林军, Pinyin: Yǔ Lín Jūn) consists of 45 stars south"
" of the Encampment, south of the *Line of Ramparts*."
msgstr ""
"*Garda do Palacio* (chinés: 羽林军, pinyin: Yǔ Lín Jūn) consta de 45 estrelas ó"
" sur do Campamento, ó sur da *Liña de Murallas*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Line of Ramparts
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Line of
#. Ramparts
msgid ""
"*Line of Ramparts* (Chinese: 垒壁阵, Pinyin: Lěi Bì Zhèn) consists of 12 stars "
"south of the *Encampment* and *Wall*, north of the *Palace Guard*."
msgstr ""
"A *Liña de Murallas* (en chinés: 垒壁阵, en pinyin: Lěi Bì Zhèn) consta de 12 "
"estrelas ó sur do *Campamento* e da *Muralla*, e ó norte da *Garda do "
"Palacio*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Axe
msgid ""
"*Axe* (Chinese: 𫓧钺, Pinyin: Fū Yuè) consists of 3 stars east of the *North "
"Gate of the Military Camp*."
msgstr ""
"*Machada* (en chinés: 𫓧钺, en pinyin: Fū Yuè) consta de 3 estrelas ó leste da"
" *Porta Norte do Campamento Militar*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation North Gate of the
#. Military Camp
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation North Gate
#. of the Military Camp
msgid ""
"*North Gate of the Military Camp* (Chinese: 北落师门, Pinyin: Běi Luò Shī Mén) "
"is 1 star southwest of the *Palace Guard*."
msgstr ""
"*Porta Norte do Campamento Militar* (Chinese: 北落师门, Pinyin: Běi Luò Shī Mén)"
" é unha estrela ó suroeste da *Garda do Palacio*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Materials for
#. Making Tents
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Materials
#. for Making Tents
msgid ""
"*Materials for Making Tents* (Chinese: 天纲, Pinyin: Tiān Gāng) is 1 star "
"southwest of the *North Gate of the Military Camp*."
msgstr ""
"*Materiais para Facer Tendas* (en chinés: 天纲, en pinyin: Tiān Gāng) está a 1"
" estrela ó suroeste da *Porta Norte do Campamento Militar*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Net for Catching
#. Birds
msgid ""
"*Net for Catching Birds* (Chinese: 八魁, Pinyin: Bā Kuí) consists of 9 stars "
"southeast of the *North Gate of the Military Camp*."
msgstr ""
"A *Rede para Cazar Paxaros* (en chinés: 八魁, en pinyin: Bā Kuí) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó sueste da *Porta Norte do Campamento Militar*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Wall
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Wall
msgid "*Wall* (Chinese: 壁宿, Pinyin: Bì Xiù) consists of 2 stars."
msgstr "*Muro* (en chinés: 壁宿, en pinyin: Bì Xiù) consta de 2 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Stable
msgid ""
"*Celestial Stable* (Chinese: 天厩, Pinyin: Tiān Jiù) consists of 10 stars "
"north of the *Wall*, near *Wang Liang*."
msgstr ""
"*Cortello Celestial* (chinés: 天厩, pinyin: Tiān Jiù) consta de 10 estrelas ó "
"norte do *Muro*, preto de *Wang Liang*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official for
#. Earthworks and Buildings
msgid ""
"*Official for Earthworks and Buildings* (Chinese: 土公, Pinyin: Tǔ Gōng) "
"consists of 2 stars south of the *Wall*."
msgstr ""
"*Oficial para Movementos de Terras e Edificios* (en chinés: 土公, en pinyin: "
"Tǔ Gōng) consta de 2 estrelas ó sur da *Muralla*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Thunderbolt
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation
#. Thunderbolt
msgid ""
"*Thunderbolt* (Chinese: 霹雳, Pinyin: Pī Lì) consists of 5 stars southwest of "
"the *Official for Earthworks and Buildings*, north of the *Cloud and Rain*."
msgstr ""
"*Lóstrego* (en chinés: 霹雳, en pinyin: Pī Lì) consta de 5 estrelas ósuroeste "
"do *Oficial de Movementos de Terras e Edificios*, e ó norte de *Nube e "
"Choiva*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Cloud and Rain
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Cloud and
#. Rain
msgid ""
"*Cloud and Rain* (Chinese: 云雨, Pinyin: Yún Yǔ) consists of 4 stars south of "
"the *Thunderbolt*, east of the *Thunder and Lightning*."
msgstr ""
"*Nube e Choiva* (en chinés: 云雨, en pinyin: Yún Yǔ) consta de 4 estrelas ó "
"sur do *Lóstrego* e ó leste de *Trono e Lóstrego*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Sickle
msgid ""
"*Sickle* (Chinese: 𫓧锧, Pinyin: Fū Zhì) consists of 5 stars southwest of the "
"*Square Celestial Granary*."
msgstr ""
"*Fouce* (en chinés: 𫓧锧, en pinyin: Fū Zhì) consta de 5 estrelas ó suroeste "
"do *Celeiro Cadrado*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Legs
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Legs
msgid "*Legs* (Chinese: 奎宿, Pinyin: Kuí Xiù) consists of 16 stars."
msgstr "*Pernas* (en chinés: 奎宿, en pinyin: Kuí Xiù) consta de 16 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Auxiliary Road
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Auxiliary
#. Road
msgid ""
"*Auxiliary Road* (Chinese: 附路, Pinyin: Fù Lù) is 1 star beside the south of "
"the *Flying Corridor*, east of *Wang Liang*."
msgstr ""
"*Vía Auxiliar* (en chinés: 附路, en pinyin: Fù Lù) situada 1 estrela ó sur do "
"*Corredor Voador*, ó leste de *Wang Liang*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Flying Corridor
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Flying
#. Corridor
msgid ""
"*Flying Corridor* (Chinese: 阁道, Pinyin: Gé Dào) consists of 6 stars in front"
" of *Wang Liang*."
msgstr ""
"O *Corredor Voador* (en chinés: 阁道, en pinyin: Gé Dào) consta de 6 estrelas "
"diante de *Wang Liang*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Wang Liang
msgid ""
"*Wang Liang* (Chinese: 王良, Pinyin: Wáng Liáng) consists of 5 stars in the "
"river north of the *Legs*."
msgstr ""
"*Wang Liang* (en chinés: 王良, en pinyin: Wáng Liáng) consta de 5 estrelas no "
"río ó norte das *Pernas*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Whip
msgid "*Whip* (Chinese: 策, Pinyin: Cè) is 1 star north of *Wang Liang*."
msgstr ""
"*Tralla* (en chinés: 策, en pinyin: Cè) está situado a 1 estrela ó norte de "
"*Wang Liang*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Southern Military
#. Gate
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Southern
#. Military Gate
msgid ""
"*Southern Military Gate* (Chinese: 军南门, Pinyin: Jūn Nán Mén) is 1 star "
"southwest of the *Great General of Heaven*."
msgstr ""
"A *Porta Militar do Sur* (en chinés: 军南门, en pinyin: Jūn Nán Mén) está "
"situada a 1 estrela ó suroeste do *Gran Xeneral do Ceo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Outer Fence
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Outer
#. Fence
msgid ""
"*Outer Fence* (Chinese: 外屏, Pinyin: Wài Píng) consists of 7 stars south of "
"the *Legs*."
msgstr ""
"*Valado Exterior* (en chinés: 外屏, en pinyin: Wài Píng) consta de 7 estrelas "
"ó sur das *Pernas*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Pigsty
msgid ""
"*Celestial Pigsty* (Chinese: 天溷, Pinyin: Tiān Hùn) consists of 7 stars south"
" of the *Outer Screen*."
msgstr ""
"*Porquiño Celestial* (en chinés: 天溷, en pinyin: Tiān Hùn) consta de 7 "
"estrelas ó sur da *Pantalla Exterior*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Master of
#. Constructions (In Legs Mansion)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Master of
#. Constructions (In Legs Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Master of Constructions* (Chinese: 土司空, Pinyin: Tǔ Sī Kōng) is 1 star south"
" of the *Legs*."
msgstr ""
"*Mestre de Construcións* (chinés: 土司空, pinyin: Tǔ Sī Kōng) é 1 estrela ó sur"
" das *Pernas*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Bond
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Bond
msgid "*Bond* (Chinese: 娄宿, Pinyin: Lóu Xiù) consists of 3 stars."
msgstr "*Ligazón* (en chinés: 娄宿, en pinyin: Lóu Xiù) ten 3 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Great General of
#. Heaven
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Great
#. General of Heaven
msgid ""
"*Great General of Heaven* (Chinese: 天大将军, Pinyin: Tiān Dà Jiāng Jūn) "
"consists of 11 stars north of the *Bond*."
msgstr ""
"*Gran Xeneral do Ceo* (chinés: 天大将军, pinyin: Tiān Dà Jiāng Jūn) consta de 11"
" estrelas ó norte de *Ligazón*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official in Charge
#. of Pasturing
msgid ""
"*Official in Charge of Pasturing* (Chinese: 右更, Pinyin: Yòu Gēng) consists "
"of 5 stars west of the *Bond*."
msgstr ""
"O *Funcionario Encargado do Pastoreo* (en chinés: 右更, en pinyin: Yòu Gēng) "
"consta de 5 estrelas ó oeste de *Ligazón*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Official in Charge
#. of the Forest
msgid ""
"*Official in Charge of the Forest* (Chinese: 左更, Pinyin: Zuǒ Gēng) consists "
"of 5 stars east of the *Bond*."
msgstr ""
"*Funcionario a Cargo do Bosque* (en chinés: 左更, en pinyin: Zuǒ Gēng) consta "
"de 5 estrelas ó leste de *Ligazón*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Square Celestial
#. Granary
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Square
#. Celestial Granary
msgid ""
"*Square Celestial Granary* (Chinese: 天仓, Pinyin: Tiān Cāng) consists of 6 "
"stars south of the *Bond*."
msgstr ""
"O *Celeiro Celestial Cadrado* (en chinés: 天仓, en pinyin: Tiān Cāng) consta "
"de 6 estrelas ó sur de *Ligazón*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Ricks of Grain
msgid ""
"*Ricks of Grain* (Chinese: 天庾, Pinyin: Tiān Yǔ) consists of 3 stars "
"southeast of the *Square Celestial Granary*."
msgstr ""
"*Moreas de Gran* (en chinés: 天庾, en pinyin: Tiān Yǔ) consta de 3 estrelas ó "
"sueste do *Celeiro Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Stomach
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Stomach
msgid "*Stomach* (Chinese: 胃宿, Pinyin: Wèi Xiù) consists of 3 stars."
msgstr "*Estómago* (en chinés: 胃宿, en pinyin: Wèi Xiù) consta de 3 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Mausoleum
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Mausoleum
msgid ""
"*Mausoleum* (Chinese: 大陵, Pinyin: Dà Líng) consists of 8 stars north of the "
"*Stomach*."
msgstr ""
"O *Mausoleo* (en chinés: 大陵, en pinyin: Dà Líng) consta de 8 estrelas ó "
"norte do *Estómago*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Heap of Corpses
#. (In Stomach Mansion)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Heap of
#. Corpses (In Stomach Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Heap of Corpses* (Chinese: 积尸, Pinyin: Jī Shī) is 1 star in the "
"*Mausoleum*."
msgstr ""
"*Morea de cadáveres* (en chinés: 积尸, en pinyin: Jī Shī) é unha estrela do "
"*Mausoleo*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Boat
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Boat
msgid ""
"*Celestial Boat* (Chinese: 天船, Pinyin: Tiān Chuán) consists of 9 stars north"
" of the *Mausoleum*, in the milky way."
msgstr ""
"*Barco Celestial* (en chinés: 天船, en pinyin: Tiān Chuán) consta de 9 "
"estrelas ó norte do *Mausoleo*, na Vía Láctea."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Stored water (In
#. Stomach Mansion)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Stored
#. water (In Stomach Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Stored water* (Chinese: 积水, Pinyin: Jī Shuǐ) is 1 star in the *Celestial "
"Boat*."
msgstr ""
"*Auga Almacenada* (en chinés: 积水, en pinyin: Jī Shuǐ) é 1 estrela no *Barco "
"Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Circular Celestial
#. Granary
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Circular
#. Celestial Granary
msgid ""
"*Circular Celestial Granary* (Chinese: 天囷, Pinyin: Tiān Qūn) consists of 13 "
"stars south of the *Stomach*, shaped like a character \"乙\"."
msgstr ""
"*Celeirto Celestial Circular* (chinés: 天囷, pinyin: Tiān Qūn) consta de 13 "
"estrelas ó sur do *Estómago*, con forma de carácter \"乙\"."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial
#. Foodstuff
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Foodstuff
msgid ""
"*Celestial Foodstuff* (Chinese: 天廪, Pinyin: Tiān Lǐn) consists of 4 stars "
"south of the *Hairy Head*."
msgstr ""
"*Alimento celestial* (en chinés: 天廪, en pinyin: Tiān Lǐn) consta de 4 "
"estrelas ó sur da *Cabeza Peluda*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Hairy Head
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Hairy Head
msgid "*Hairy Head* (Chinese: 昴宿, Pinyin: Mǎo Xiù) consists of 7 stars."
msgstr ""
"*Cabeza Peluda* (en chinés: 昴宿, en pinyin: Mǎo Xiù) consta de 7 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Concave
msgid ""
"*Celestial Concave* (Chinese: 天阿, Pinyin: Tiān Ā) is 1 star northwest of the"
" *Hairy Head*."
msgstr ""
"*Cóncavo Celestial* (en chinés: 天阿, en pinyin: Tiān Ā) está situado a 1 "
"estrela ó noroeste da *Cabeza Peluda*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Rolled Tongue
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Rolled
#. Tongue
msgid ""
"*Rolled Tongue* (Chinese: 卷舌, Pinyin: Juǎn Shé) consists of 6 stars north of"
" the *Hairy Head*."
msgstr ""
"*Lingua Enrolada* (en chinés: 卷舌, en pinyin: Juǎn Shé) consta de 6 estrelas "
"ó norte da *Cabeza Peluda*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Slander
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Slander
msgid ""
"*Celestial Slander* (Chinese: 天谗, Pinyin: Tiān Chán) is 1 star in the "
"*Rolled Tongue*."
msgstr ""
"*Calumnia Celestial* (en chinés: 天谗, en pinyin: Tiān Chán) é 1 estrela na "
"*Lingua Enrolada*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Whetstone
msgid ""
"*Whetstone* (Chinese: 砺石, Pinyin: Lì Shí) consists of 4 stars southeast of "
"the *Rolled Tongue*."
msgstr ""
"*Pedra de Afiar* (en chinés: 砺石, en pinyin: Lì Shí) consta de 4 estrelas ó "
"sueste da *Lingua Enrolada*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Lunar Star
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Lunar Star
msgid ""
"*Lunar Star* (Chinese: 月, Pinyin: Yuè) is 1 star east of the *Hairy Head*."
msgstr ""
"A *Estrela Lunar* (en chinés: 月, en pinyin: Yuè) está situada unha estrela ó"
" leste da *Cabeza Peluda*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Yin
#. Force
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Yin Force
msgid ""
"*Celestial Yin Force* (Chinese: 天阴, Pinyin: Tiān Yīn) consists of 5 stars "
"west of the *Net*'s handle."
msgstr ""
"A *Forza Yin Celestial* (en chinés: 天阴, en pinyin: Tiān Yīn) consta de 5 "
"estrelas ó oeste da asa da *Rede*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Hay
msgid ""
"*Hay* (Chinese: 刍藁, Pinyin: Chú Gǎo) consists of 6 stars west of the "
"*Celestial Meadows*."
msgstr ""
"*Feo* (en chinés: 刍藁, en pinyin: Chú Gǎo) consta de 6 estrelas ó oeste dos "
"*Prados Celestiais*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Meadows
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Meadows
msgid ""
"*Celestial Meadows* (Chinese: 天苑, Pinyin: Tiān Yuàn) consists of 16 stars "
"south of the *Net*."
msgstr ""
"*Prados Celestiais* (en chinés: 天苑, en pinyin: Tiān Yuàn) constan de 16 "
"estrelas ó sur da *Rede*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Net
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Net
msgid "*Net* (Chinese: 毕宿, Pinyin: Bì Xiù) consists of 8 stars."
msgstr "*Rede* (en chinés: 毕宿, en pinyin: Bì Xiù) consta de 8 estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Whisper (Vassal of
#. Net)
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Whisper
#. (Vassal of Net)
msgid "*Whisper* (Chinese: 附耳, Pinyin: Fù Ěr) is 1 star under the *Net*."
msgstr ""
"*Susurro* (en chinés: 附耳, en pinyin: Fù Ěr) está 1 estrela por debaixo da "
"*Rede*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Street
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Street
msgid ""
"*Celestial Street* (Chinese: 天街, Pinyin: Tiān Jiē) consists of 2 stars "
"between the *Hairy Head* and *Net*, near the east of the *Lunar Star*."
msgstr ""
"A *Rúa Celestial* (en chinés: 天街, en pinyin: Tiān Jiē) consta de dúas "
"estrelas entre a *Cabeza Peluda* e a *Rede*, preto do leste da *Estrela "
"Lunar*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Feudal Kings
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Feudal
#. Kings
msgid ""
"*Feudal Kings* (Chinese: 诸王, Pinyin: Zhū Wáng) consists of 6 stars south of "
"the *Five Chariots*."
msgstr ""
"*Reis Feudais* (en chinés: 诸王, en pinyin: Zhū Wáng) consta de 6 estrelas ó "
"sur dos *Cinco Carros*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial High
#. Terrace
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. High Terrace
msgid ""
"*Celestial High Terrace* (Chinese: 天高, Pinyin: Tiān Gāo) consists of 4 stars"
" west of the *Banner of Three Stars*, near the *Net*."
msgstr ""
"A *Terraza Celestial Alta* (en chinés: 天高, en pinyin: Tiān Gāo) consta de 4 "
"estrelas ó oeste da *Estandarte das Tres Estrelas*, preto da *Rede*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Five Chariots
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Five
#. Chariots
msgid ""
"*Five Chariots* (Chinese: 五车, Pinyin: Wǔ Chē) consists of 5 stars northeast "
"of the *Net*."
msgstr ""
"*Cinco Carros* (en chinés: 五车, en pinyin: Wǔ Chē) consiste en 5 estrelas ó "
"nordeste da *Rede*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Pillars (In Net
#. Mansion)
msgid ""
"*Pillars* (Chinese: 柱, Pinyin: Zhù) consists of 9 stars northeast of the "
"*Net*."
msgstr ""
"*Piares* (en chinés: 柱, en pinyin: Zhù) constan de 9 estrelas ó nordeste da "
"*Rede*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Pier
msgid ""
"*Celestial Pier* (Chinese: 天潢, Pinyin: Tiān Huáng) consists of 5 stars in "
"the *Five Chariots*."
msgstr ""
"O *Peirao Celestial* (en chinés: 天潢, en pinyin: Tiān Huáng) consta de 5 "
"estrelas nos *Cinco Carros*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Pool of Harmony
msgid ""
"*Pool of Harmony* (Chinese: 咸池, Pinyin: Xián Chí) consists of 3 stars "
"northwest of the *Celestial Pier*."
msgstr ""
"*Estanque da Harmonía* (en chinés: 咸池, en pinyin: Xián Chí) consta de 3 "
"estrelas ó noroeste do *Peirao Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Pass
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Celestial
#. Pass
msgid ""
"*Celestial Pass* (Chinese: 天关, Pinyin: Tiān Guān) is 1 star south of the "
"*Five Chariots*, northwest of the *Three Stars*."
msgstr ""
"O *Paso Celestial* (en chinés: 天关, en pinyin: Tiān Guān) está situado a 1 "
"estrela ó sur dos *Cinco Carros* e ó noroeste das *Tres Estrelas*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Tally
msgid ""
"*Celestial Tally* (Chinese: 天节, Pinyin: Tiān Jié) consists of 8 stars south "
"of the *Net* and *Whisper*."
msgstr ""
"*Reconto Celestial* (en chinés: 天节, en pinyin: Tiān Jié) consta de 8 "
"estrelas ó sur da *Rede* e do *Susurro*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Interpreters of
#. Nine Dialects
msgid ""
"*Interpreters of Nine Dialects* (Chinese: 九州殊口, Pinyin: Jiǔ Zhōu Shū Kǒu) "
"consists of 9 stars under the *Celestial Tally*."
msgstr ""
"*Intérpretes de Nove Dialectos* (en chinés: 九州殊口, en pinyin: Jiǔ Zhōu Shū "
"Kǒu) consta de 9 estrelas baixo o *Reconto Celestial*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Banner of Three
#. Stars
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Banner of
#. Three Stars
msgid ""
"*Banner of Three Stars* (Chinese: 参旗, Pinyin: Shēn Qí) consists of 9 stars "
"west of the *Three Stars*."
msgstr ""
"O *Estandarte das Tres Estrelas* (en chinés: 参旗, en pinyin: Shēn Qí) consta "
"de 9 estrelas ó oeste das *Tres Estrelas*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Imperial Military
#. Flag
msgid ""
"*Imperial Military Flag* (Chinese: 九斿, Pinyin: Jiǔ Yóu) consists of 9 stars "
"southwest of the *Jade Well*."
msgstr ""
"A *Bandeira Militar Imperial* (en chinés: 九斿, en pinyin: Jiǔ Yóu) consta de "
"9 estrelas ó suroeste do *Pozo de Xade*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Celestial Orchard
msgid ""
"*Celestial Orchard* (Chinese: 天园, Pinyin: Tiān Yuán) consists of 13 stars "
"south of the *Celestial Meadows*."
msgstr ""
"O *Pomar Celestial* (en chinés: 天园, en pinyin: Tiān Yuán) consta de 13 "
"estrelas ó sur dos *Prados Celestiais*."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Turtle Beak
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Turtle
#. Beak
msgid "*Turtle Beak* (Chinese: 觜宿, Pinyin: Zī Xiù) consists of 3 stars."
msgstr ""
"*Peteiro de Tartaruga* (en chinés: 觜宿, en pinyin: Zī Xiù) consta de 3 "
"estrelas."

#. Description of Chinese Xianglin Star Chart constellation Deity in Charge of
#. Monsters
#. Description of Chinese Yuan Dynasty (14th Century) constellation Deity in
#. Charge of Monsters
msgid ""
"*Deity in Charge of Monsters* (Chinese: 司怪, Pinyin: Sī Guài) consists of 4 "
"stars in front of the *Well* and the *Battle Axe*."
msgstr ""
"*Deidade Encargada dos Monstros* (chinés: 司怪, pinyin: Sī Guài) consta de 4 "
